{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WVCr7iiMJuy2uFwwAfK6gj","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '切换到 Framing A：checkpoint selection criterion dominates mining\n2\t  strategy。\n3\t\n4\t  主贡献重排：(1) 发现 checkpoint 选择标准对 reported performance 的影响（+10-16pp）远大于 mining strategy\n5\t  差异（<1pp），\n6\t\n7\t  揭示领域内 evaluation methodology 系统性问题；(2) 在此框架下，embedding mining 作为 controlled experiment\n8\t  的一个 condition，\n9\t\n10\t  在 Qwen 上有 marginal positive signal，但非 universal；(3) representation geometry 分析解释\n11\t  why effect is encoder-dependent。\n12\t\n13\t  BM25 neutral → 不能 claim CoCoHaNeRe 的 BM25 proxy 有害，改为 \"mining strategy choice matters\n14\t  less than evaluation methodology\"。\n15\t\n16\t  Statistical framing：承认 3 seeds underpowered for <1pp effects，用 effect size + CI\n17\t  报告而非 p-value。\n18\t\n19\t  '\n20\timagined_experiments:\n21\t- name: M2 Full Qwen 完整 9-run 最终结果\n22\t  plan_id: plan_002 / m2_full_qwen_continued\n23\t  description: 3 strategies × 3 seeds × Qwen2.5-Coder-3B 全量训练收敛后完整对比\n24\t  expected_results:\n25\t    random_s42_R@1: 0.5527\n26\t    random_s43_R@1: 0.5554\n27\t    random_s44_R@1: 0.6009\n28\t    random_mean_R@1: 0.5697\n29\t    random_std_pp: 2.74\n30\t    embed_s42_R@1: 0.5613\n31\t    embed_s43_R@1: 0.5655\n32\t    embed_s44_R@1: 0.5942\n33\t    embed_mean_R@1: 0.5737\n34\t    embed_std_pp: 1.81\n35\t    dataflow_s42_R@1: 0.551\n36\t    dataflow_s43_R@1: 0.5564\n37\t    dataflow_s44_R@1: 0.572\n38\t    dataflow_mean_R@1: 0.5598\n39\t    dataflow_std_pp: 1.1\n40\t    embed_vs_random_mean_delta_pp: 0.4\n41\t    dataflow_vs_random_mean_delta_pp: -0.99\n42\t    embed_vs_random_95CI_pp:\n43\t    - -0.8\n44\t    - 1.6\n45\t    dataflow_vs_random_95CI_pp:\n46\t    - -2.2\n47\t    - 0.2\n48\t    cross_seed_std_random_pp: 2.74\n49\t    bootstrap_95ci_embed_excludes_zero: false\n50\t  result_rationale: 's44 random 异常高（0.6009 vs s42/s43 ~0.554）导致 random mean 被拉高，embed_s44\n51\t    也高但不及 random_s44，\n52\t\n53\t    使得 paired delta 在 s44 上为负（-0.67pp）。s42 和 s43 embed 各高 +0.86pp 和 +1.01pp。\n54\t\n55\t    三个 seed 的 delta 方差大（std≈0.9pp），3 sample 的 95% CI 宽度约 2.4pp，下界包含零。\n56\t\n57\t    这是 median 档核心特征：effect exists but underpowered detection。\n58\t\n59\t    Dataflow 因缺少结构数据的 instance（66% fallback to random）稀释了效果，mean slightly below random。\n60\t\n61\t    '\n62\t  tables:\n63\t  - name: 'Table 1: Qwen2.5-Coder-3B R@1 (pool=8, best_by_R@1 checkpoint)'\n64\t    columns:\n65\t    - Strategy\n66\t    - s42\n67\t    - s43\n68\t    - s44\n69\t    - Mean\n70\t    - Std\n71\t    - Δ vs Random\n72\t    rows:\n73\t    - - Random\n74\t      - 0.5527\n75\t      - 0.5554\n76\t      - 0.6009\n77\t      - 0.5697\n78\t      - 0.0274\n79\t      - —\n80\t    - - Embedding\n81\t      - 0.5613\n82\t      - 0.5655\n83\t      - 0.5942\n84\t      - 0.5737\n85\t      - 0.0181\n86\t      - +0.40pp\n87\t    - - Dataflow\n88\t      - 0.551\n89\t      - 0.5564\n90\t      - 0.572\n91\t      - 0.5598\n92\t      - 0.011\n93\t      - -0.99pp\n94\t  figures_description:\n95\t  - 'Fig 1: Per-seed paired delta (embed-random) bar chart with error bars showing\n96\t    seed-level inconsistency'\n97\t  analysis: 'Embed 在 2/3 seeds 上有正 delta（s42: +0.86pp, s43: +1.01pp），但 s44 为 -0.67pp。\n98\t\n99\t    Mean delta +0.40pp 是 real signal 但 95% CI [-0.8, 1.6] 包含零。\n100\t\n101\t    Dataflow 整体不如 random，因为 66% 的 instance 实际拿到的是 random fallback negatives。\n102\t\n103\t    Cross-seed variance (2.74pp for random) >> strategy effect (0.4pp)，这是 paper pivot\n104\t    到\n105\t\n106\t    methodology framing 的关键数据支撑。\n107\t\n108\t    '\n109\t- name: M2 Full StarCoder 完整 9-run 最终结果\n110\t  plan_id: plan_002 / m2_full_starcoder_resumed\n111\t  description: 3 strategies × 3 seeds × StarCoder2-3B 全量训练\n112\t  expected_results:\n113\t    random_s42_R@1: 0.4604\n114\t    random_s43_R@1: 0.4859\n115\t    random_s44_R@1: 0.4897\n116\t    random_mean_R@1: 0.4787\n117\t    random_std_pp: 1.62\n118\t    embed_s42_R@1: 0.4567\n119\t    embed_s43_R@1: 0.487\n120\t    embed_s44_R@1: 0.4905\n121\t    embed_mean_R@1: 0.4781\n122\t    embed_std_pp: 1.85\n123\t    dataflow_s42_R@1: 0.449\n124\t    dataflow_s43_R@1: 0.478\n125\t    dataflow_s44_R@1: 0.483\n126\t    dataflow_mean_R@1: 0.47\n127\t    dataflow_std_pp: 1.88\n128\t    embed_vs_random_mean_delta_pp: -0.06\n129\t    dataflow_vs_random_mean_delta_pp: -0.87\n130\t    embed_vs_random_95CI_pp:\n131\t    - -1.4\n132\t    - 1.3\n133\t    bootstrap_95ci_embed_excludes_zero: false\n134\t  result_rationale: 'StarCoder embed_s42 已确认为负（0.4567 vs random 0.4604 = -0.37pp）。\n135\t\n136\t    s43/s44 embed 会 track random closely（StarCoder 有 healthy geometry，pos_sim≈0.80，\n137\t\n138\t    margin 本身充足，embedding mining 提供的额外 difficulty gradient 不如 Qwen 有效）。\n139\t\n140\t    Mean delta 落在 -0.2 to +0.3pp 中间偏负。Dataflow 更弱因为 StarCoder embedding space\n141\t\n142\t    对 structural signal 的敏感度更低（margin 本身大，dataflow negatives 没有提供足够的 incremental difficulty）。\n143\t\n144\t    '\n145\t  tables:\n146\t  - name: 'Table 2: StarCoder2-3B R@1 (pool=8, best_by_R@1 checkpoint)'\n147\t    columns:\n148\t    - Strategy\n149\t    - s42\n150\t    - s43\n151\t    - s44\n152\t    - Mean\n153\t    - Std\n154\t    - Δ vs Random\n155\t    rows:\n156\t    - - Random\n157\t      - 0.4604\n158\t      - 0.4859\n159\t      - 0.4897\n160\t      - 0.4787\n161\t      - 0.0162\n162\t      - —\n163\t    - - Embedding\n164\t      - 0.4567\n165\t      - 0.487\n166\t      - 0.4905\n167\t      - 0.4781\n168\t      - 0.0185\n169\t      - -0.06pp\n170\t    - - Dataflow\n171\t      - 0.449\n172\t      - 0.478\n173\t      - 0.483\n174\t      - 0.47\n175\t      - 0.0188\n176\t      - -0.87pp\n177\t  figures_description:\n178\t  - 'Fig 2: StarCoder strategy comparison — all strategies within noise floor'\n179\t  analysis: 'StarCoder 确认 embedding mining 无效。与 Qwen 的差异来自 representation geometry：\n180\t\n181\t    pos_sim=0.80 意味着 random negatives 已有足够 margin（0.194），embedding mining 的额外\n182\t\n183\t    difficulty 不产生 learning signal gain。这支持 \"effect is encoder-specific\" 论断。\n184\t\n185\t    '\n186\t- name: BM25 Negative Baseline 训练\n187\t  plan_id: plan_018\n188\t  description: BM25-based hard negatives 作为第 4 策略，3 seeds × 2 encoders 训练对比\n189\t  expected_results:\n190\t    qwen_bm25_s42_R@1: 0.554\n191\t    qwen_bm25_s43_R@1: 0.558\n192\t    qwen_bm25_s44_R@1: 0.598\n193\t    qwen_bm25_mean_R@1: 0.57\n194\t    qwen_bm25_vs_random_delta_pp: 0.03\n195\t    starcoder_bm25_s42_R@1: 0.458\n196\t    starcoder_bm25_s43_R@1: 0.483\n197\t    starcoder_bm25_s44_R@1: 0.487\n198\t    starcoder_bm25_mean_R@1: 0.476\n199\t    starcoder_bm25_vs_random_delta_pp: -0.27\n200\t    bm25_vs_random_pooled_delta_pp:\n201\t    - -0.5\n202\t    - 0.5\n203\t    bm25_vs_embedding_qwen_delta_pp: -0.37\n204\t  result_rationale: 'BM25 negatives 与 random 几乎无差异。原因：BM25 top-k 与 embedding top-k\n205\t    有 87.1% overlap\n206\t\n207\t    （已从 phase1 overlap analysis 确认），但 BM25 ranking ≠ embedding ranking，\n208\t\n209\t    实际选中的 top-7 在 medium/large repo 上 Jaccard 仅 0.30-0.38。\n210\t\n211\t    BM25 选出的 negatives 在 lexical space 中是 hard 的，但不一定在 encoder embedding space 中是\n212\t    hard 的。\n213\t\n214\t    对于 Qwen（saturated space），BM25 negatives 的 effective difficulty 介于 random 和 embedding\n215\t    之间，\n216\t\n217\t    但因为 Qwen space 几乎所有 pairs 都高相似度，BM25 的 lexical-hard 不等于 embedding-hard。\n218\t\n219\t    对于 StarCoder（healthy space），BM25 和 random 都落在 \"sufficient margin\" 区间，无差异。\n220\t\n221\t    关键结论：不能 claim CoCoHaNeRe 的 BM25 方法有害。Narrative pivot to \"strategy choice < methodology\"。\n222\t\n223\t    '\n224\t  tables:\n225\t  - name: 'Table 3: BM25 vs Other Strategies (R@1 pool=8)'\n226\t    columns:\n227\t    - Encoder\n228\t    - Random\n229\t    - BM25\n230\t    - Embedding\n231\t    - Dataflow\n232\t    rows:\n233\t    - - Qwen\n234\t      - 0.5697\n235\t      - 0.57\n236\t      - 0.5737\n237\t      - 0.5598\n238\t    - - StarCoder\n239\t      - 0.4787\n240\t      - 0.476\n241\t      - 0.4781\n242\t      - 0.47\n243\t  figures_description:\n244\t  - 'Fig 3: 4-strategy comparison showing all strategies within 1pp of random — mining\n245\t    choice is dominated by methodology'\n246\t  analysis: 'BM25 ≈ random 否定了原始 narrative（CoCoHaNeRe BM25 proxy harmful）。\n247\t\n248\t    Paper 必须 pivot：不是 \"BM25 harms\" 而是 \"all strategies ≈ equivalent when checkpoint\n249\t    criterion dominates\"。\n250\t\n251\t    这实际上 strengthens Framing A——如果连最 effortful 的 mining 都只有 <1pp 差异，\n252\t\n253\t    那 checkpoint selection criterion (+10-16pp) 才是真正需要关注的 methodology gap。\n254\t\n255\t    '\n256\t- name: Pool Size Sensitivity Analysis\n257\t  plan_id: plan_019\n258\t  description: 在 pool={8, 50, 100, 200, 500} 上评估策略排序稳定性\n259\t  expected_results:\n260\t    qwen_embed_pool_8_R@1: 0.5737\n261\t    qwen_embed_pool_50_R@1: 0.432\n262\t    qwen_embed_pool_100_R@1: 0.365\n263\t    qwen_embed_pool_200_R@1: 0.288\n264\t    qwen_embed_pool_500_R@1: 0.195\n265\t    qwen_random_pool_8_R@1: 0.5697\n266\t    qwen_random_pool_50_R@1: 0.428\n267\t    qwen_random_pool_100_R@1: 0.361\n268\t    qwen_random_pool_200_R@1: 0.284\n269\t    qwen_random_pool_500_R@1: 0.191\n270\t    embed_vs_random_delta_pool_8_pp: 0.4\n271\t    embed_vs_random_delta_pool_50_pp: 0.4\n272\t    embed_vs_random_delta_pool_100_pp: 0.4\n273\t    embed_vs_random_delta_pool_200_pp: 0.4\n274\t    embed_vs_random_delta_pool_500_pp: 0.4\n275\t    criterion_effect_pool8_vs_pool50_pp: 14.2\n276\t    criterion_effect_pool8_vs_pool100_pp: 20.9\n277\t    strategy_ranking_preserved_across_pools: true\n278\t  result_rationale: 'Pool size 增大时 absolute R@1 急剧下降（从 pool=8 的 ~0.57 到 pool=50 的\n279\t    ~0.43，drop 14pp），\n280\t\n281\t    因为正确答案在更大 candidate pool 中更难排到第一。\n282\t\n283\t    但 strategy delta 保持稳定（~0.4pp），因为 mining strategy 影响的是 encoder 的 relative ranking\n284\t    ability，\n285\t\n286\t    与 pool size 无关。\n287\t\n288\t    这是 paper 最强的 methodology insight：pool=8 validation 产生的 absolute R@1 数字\n289\t\n290\t    在 pool=50 test 上 drop 10-16pp。如果研究者用 pool=8 选 checkpoint 再在 pool=50 报告，\n291\t\n292\t    选中的 checkpoint 不一定是 pool=50 上最优的——这个 criterion mismatch 的 effect 远大于 strategy\n293\t    difference。\n294\t\n295\t    具体而言：同一 checkpoint 在 pool=8 上 R@1=0.57 但在 pool=50 上只有 0.43，\n296\t\n297\t    而另一个 checkpoint 可能 pool=8 上 R@1=0.55（被 criterion reject）但 pool=50 上 R@1=0.45（实际更好）。\n298\t\n299\t    这个 +10-16pp criterion effect 就是 pool-size-driven checkpoint selection mismatch。\n300\t\n301\t    '\n302\t  tables:\n303\t  - name: 'Table 4: R@1 by Pool Size (Qwen, embedding strategy, mean across seeds)'\n304\t    columns:\n305\t    - Pool\n306\t    - R@1\n307\t    - Δ vs pool=8\n308\t    rows:\n309\t    - - 8\n310\t      - 0.5737\n311\t      - —\n312\t    - - 50\n313\t      - 0.432\n314\t      - -14.2pp\n315\t    - - 100\n316\t      - 0.365\n317\t      - -20.9pp\n318\t    - - 200\n319\t      - 0.288\n320\t      - -28.6pp\n321\t    - - 500\n322\t      - 0.195\n323\t      - -37.9pp\n324\t  - name: 'Table 5: Strategy Δ Stability Across Pool Sizes'\n325\t    columns:\n326\t    - Pool\n327\t    - Embed-Random Δ\n328\t    - Dataflow-Random Δ\n329\t    - BM25-Random Δ\n330\t    rows:\n331\t    - - 8\n332\t      - +0.40pp\n333\t      - -0.99pp\n334\t      - +0.03pp\n335\t    - - 50\n336\t      - +0.38pp\n337\t      - -1.05pp\n338\t      - +0.05pp\n339\t    - - 100\n340\t      - +0.42pp\n341\t      - -0.92pp\n342\t      - -0.02pp\n343\t    - - 200\n344\t      - +0.39pp\n345\t      - -1.01pp\n346\t      - +0.08pp\n347\t    - - 500\n348\t      - +0.41pp\n349\t      - -0.98pp\n350\t      - +0.01pp\n351\t  figures_description:\n352\t  - 'Fig 4: Dual-axis plot — left: absolute R@1 drops sharply with pool size; right:\n353\t    strategy delta remains flat at <1pp'\n354\t  - 'Fig 5: Criterion effect visualization — same checkpoint, two pool sizes, 14pp\n355\t    gap annotated'\n356\t  analysis: 'Strategy ranking 在所有 pool size 下保持一致（embed > random > dataflow），但 delta\n357\t    < 1pp。\n358\t\n359\t    绝对 R@1 随 pool 增大下降 ~14pp (pool 8→50)，这就是 \"criterion effect\" 的来源：\n360\t\n361\t    如果用 pool=8 validation 选择 checkpoint，切换到 pool=50 test 时报告值 drop 10-16pp。\n362\t\n363\t    更重要的是，pool=8 上的 \"best checkpoint\" 不一定是 pool=50 上的 best——\n364\t\n365\t    不同 checkpoint 在不同 pool size 下的 ranking 会 shuffle。\n366\t\n367\t    这是 paper 的核心方法论贡献，远比 <1pp 的 strategy delta 有实际意义。\n368\t\n369\t    '\n370\t- name: Checkpoint Selection Criterion Effect Analysis\n371\t  plan_id: plan_019 (derived)\n372\t  description: 直接量化：不同 checkpoint 选择标准对 reported R@1 的影响\n373\t  expected_results:\n374\t    qwen_random_s42_best_by_valloss_R@1_pool50: 0.415\n375\t    qwen_random_s42_best_by_R@1_pool8_R@1_pool50: 0.428\n376\t    qwen_random_s42_best_by_R@1_pool50_R@1_pool50: 0.442\n377\t    criterion_gap_valloss_vs_R@1pool50_pp: 2.7\n378\t    criterion_gap_R@1pool8_vs_R@1pool50_pp: 1.4\n379\t    best_seed_best_criterion_R@1_pool50: 0.458\n380\t    worst_seed_worst_criterion_R@1_pool50: 0.398\n381\t    total_methodology_range_pp: 6.0\n382\t    strategy_effect_max_pp: 0.4\n383\t    methodology_vs_strategy_ratio: 15.0\n384\t  result_rationale: '在 pool=50 evaluation 上，checkpoint criterion 差异可达 2-3pp per run。\n385\t\n386\t    跨 seed 时（best seed + best criterion vs worst seed + worst criterion），总 methodology\n387\t    range 达 6pp。\n388\t\n389\t    如果进一步考虑 pool=8 training validation 与 pool=50 test 的 mismatch（14pp absolute drop），\n390\t\n391\t    以及不同 epoch 的 checkpoint 在 pool=50 上的排序变化（best pool=8 ≠ best pool=50），\n392\t\n393\t    整个 \"methodology confound\" 量级为 10-16pp（包含 pool effect + criterion selection + seed\n394\t    variance）。\n395\t\n396\t    相比之下，strategy effect 最大 0.4pp。ratio = 15-40x。\n397\t\n398\t    这就是 paper 最强贡献：researchers 应该先解决 methodology（pool size, criterion, seed aggregation），\n399\t\n400\t    再讨论 mining strategy。\n401\t\n402\t    '\n403\t  tables:\n404\t  - name: 'Table 6: Methodology Confound Decomposition'\n405\t    columns:\n406\t    - Source\n407\t    - Effect Size (pp)\n408\t    - Controllable\n409\t    rows:\n410\t    - - Pool size (8→50)\n411\t      - '14.2'\n412\t      - Yes — report on realistic pool\n413\t    - - Checkpoint criterion (val_loss vs R@1)\n414\t      - '2.7'\n415\t      - Yes — use target metric\n416\t    - - Seed variance\n417\t      - '2.7'\n418\t      - Partially — report mean±std\n419\t    - - Mining strategy\n420\t      - '0.4'\n421\t      - Choice variable\n422\t    - - Total methodology range\n423\t      - 10-16\n424\t      - —\n425\t  figures_description:\n426\t  - 'Fig 6: Stacked bar showing methodology effect decomposition — strategy is <5%\n427\t    of total variation'\n428\t  analysis: '这是 median 档 paper 的核心贡献。从 \"mining strategy matters\" 转向\n429\t\n430\t    \"evaluation methodology dominates, mining strategy is noise\"。\n431\t\n432\t    具体分解：pool size effect(14pp) > seed variance(2.7pp) > criterion(2.7pp) >> strategy(0.4pp)。\n433\t\n434\t    Paper 的 prescriptive contribution：(1) 永远报告 pool=50+ 的 R@1；\n435\t\n436\t    (2) 用目标 metric 选 checkpoint 而非 val_loss；(3) 报告 mean±CI 跨 seeds。\n437\t\n438\t    '\n439\t- name: RepoBench-R Cross-file Retrieval Evaluation\n440\t  plan_id: plan_004\n441\t  description: RepoBench-R test_easy/test_hard 上 3 strategies × 3 seeds 评估\n442\t  expected_results:\n443\t    qwen_random_easy_R@1_mean: 0.682\n444\t    qwen_embed_easy_R@1_mean: 0.687\n445\t    qwen_dataflow_easy_R@1_mean: 0.679\n446\t    embed_vs_random_easy_delta_pp: 0.5\n447\t    embed_vs_random_easy_95CI_pp:\n448\t    - -0.3\n449\t    - 1.3\n450\t    qwen_random_hard_R@1_mean: 0.415\n451\t    qwen_embed_hard_R@1_mean: 0.419\n452\t    qwen_dataflow_hard_R@1_mean: 0.411\n453\t    embed_vs_random_hard_delta_pp: 0.4\n454\t    embed_vs_random_hard_95CI_pp:\n455\t    - -0.5\n456\t    - 1.3\n457\t    starcoder_random_hard_R@1_mean: 0.358\n458\t    starcoder_embed_hard_R@1_mean: 0.357\n459\t    starcoder_embed_vs_random_hard_delta_pp: -0.1\n460\t    ci_overlap_easy: true\n461\t    ci_overlap_hard: true\n462\t  result_rationale: 'RepoBench-R 是 cross-file retrieval task，与 SWE-smith 相比 domain\n463\t    shift 较小\n464\t\n465\t    （同为 code retrieval 而非 repair），所以模型 transfer 好于 SWE-bench（OOD failure）。\n466\t\n467\t    Direction 一致（Qwen embed > random）但效果量与 SWE-smith 内部评估一致（~0.4-0.5pp），\n468\t\n469\t    95% CI 因为 bootstrap over 8K instances 虽然窄一些但仍包含零\n470\t\n471\t    （因为 per-instance variance 大，且效果量太小）。\n472\t\n473\t    StarCoder 同样 null，与 SWE-smith 结果一致。\n474\t\n475\t    RepoBench-R 的主要价值是 \"directional consistency\" 而非 \"statistical confirmation\"。\n476\t\n477\t    '\n478\t  tables:\n479\t  - name: 'Table 7: RepoBench-R Results (mean R@1 ± 95% CI)'\n480\t    columns:\n481\t    - Encoder\n482\t    - Split\n483\t    - Random\n484\t    - Embedding\n485\t    - Δ (CI)\n486\t    rows:\n487\t    - - Qwen\n488\t      - easy\n489\t      - '0.682'\n490\t      - '0.687'\n491\t      - +0.5pp (-0.3, 1.3)\n492\t    - - Qwen\n493\t      - hard\n494\t      - '0.415'\n495\t      - '0.419'\n496\t      - +0.4pp (-0.5, 1.3)\n497\t    - - StarCoder\n498\t      - easy\n499\t      - '0.612'\n500\t      - '0.611'\n501\t      - -0.1pp (-0.9, 0.7)\n502\t    - - StarCoder\n503\t      - hard\n504\t      - '0.358'\n505\t      - '0.357'\n506\t      - -0.1pp (-1.0, 0.8)\n507\t  figures_description:\n508\t  - 'Fig 7: RepoBench-R delta plot with CIs — directional consistency for Qwen but\n509\t    CIs include zero'\n510\t  analysis: 'RepoBench-R 作为 supplementary validation 支持 directional claim 但不提供 statistical\n511\t    significance。\n512\t\n513\t    在 median 档的 methodology-first framing 下，这反而 reinforces 主论点：\n514\t\n515\t    <1pp effects 即使 directionally consistent 也无法在 standard evaluation 中 reliably detect。\n516\t\n517\t    '\n518\t- name: Temperature Ablation Reduced\n519\t  plan_id: plan_021\n520\t  description: τ ∈ {0.05, 0.2} × random+embedding × Qwen × seed 42\n521\t  expected_results:\n522\t    tau005_random_R@1: 0.535\n523\t    tau005_embed_R@1: 0.541\n524\t    tau005_embed_vs_random_pp: 0.6\n525\t    tau010_random_R@1: 0.5527\n526\t    tau010_embed_R@1: 0.5613\n527\t    tau010_embed_vs_random_pp: 0.86\n528\t    tau020_random_R@1: 0.568\n529\t    tau020_embed_R@1: 0.57\n530\t    tau020_embed_vs_random_pp: 0.2\n531\t    strategy_ranking_preserved: true\n532\t    delta_magnitude_varies: true\n533\t    tau005_vs_tau010_absolute_gap_pp: 1.77\n534\t    tau020_vs_tau010_absolute_gap_pp: 1.53\n535\t  result_rationale: 'τ=0.05 使 loss landscape 更 sharp，对 hard negatives 更 sensitive——理论上应放大\n536\t    mining effect。\n537\t\n538\t    实际上 τ=0.05 更容易 overfit（已在 pilot 中观察到），absolute R@1 略低于 τ=0.10。\n539\t\n540\t    但 embed-random delta 在 τ=0.05 下 slightly larger（0.6pp vs 0.86pp... 实际上更小）。\n541\t\n542\t    τ=0.20 使 contrastive loss 更 smooth，random 和 embed 差异缩小（0.2pp），\n543\t\n544\t    因为 softer temperature 减少了 hard negative 的 informative gradient signal。\n545\t\n546\t    关键结论：strategy ranking 在所有 τ 下保持（embed ≥ random），但 effect magnitude 与 τ 相关。\n547\t\n548\t    这意味着 mining effect 不是 regime-specific artifact，但其 practical significance 受 τ 调制。\n549\t\n550\t    对 methodology framing：τ 选择（absolute R@1 vary ~2pp across τ）也是一个 methodology confound，\n551\t\n552\t    量级仍 > strategy effect（0.2-0.9pp）。\n553\t\n554\t    '\n555\t  tables:\n556\t  - name: 'Table 8: Temperature × Strategy Interaction (Qwen, s42)'\n557\t    columns:\n558\t    - τ\n559\t    - Random R@1\n560\t    - Embed R@1\n561\t    - Δ (pp)\n562\t    rows:\n563\t    - - 0.05\n564\t      - 0.535\n565\t      - 0.541\n566\t      - '+0.60'\n567\t    - - 0.1\n568\t      - 0.5527\n569\t      - 0.5613\n570\t      - '+0.86'\n571\t    - - 0.2\n572\t      - 0.568\n573\t      - 0.57\n574\t      - '+0.20'\n575\t  figures_description:\n576\t  - 'Fig 8: Temperature effect on absolute R@1 (~2pp range) vs strategy effect (<1pp)\n577\t    — another methodology factor'\n578\t  analysis: 'Embed advantage 在所有 τ 下存在但 magnitude 随 τ 变化。这 rules out \"effect is τ=0.1\n579\t    artifact\"。\n580\t\n581\t    同时也展示了 τ 是另一个 methodology confound（2pp range），再次支持 criterion-dominates framing。\n582\t\n583\t    '\n584\t- name: Dynamic Embedding Mining Baseline\n585\t  plan_id: plan_015\n586\t  description: 每 epoch 重新 mine embedding negatives vs 只用 pretrained（static）\n587\t  expected_results:\n588\t    qwen_static_embed_R@1: 0.5613\n589\t    qwen_dynamic_embed_R@1: 0.564\n590\t    dynamic_vs_static_delta_pp: 0.27\n591\t    starcoder_static_embed_R@1: 0.4567\n592\t    starcoder_dynamic_embed_R@1: 0.459\n593\t    dynamic_vs_static_sc_delta_pp: 0.23\n594\t    dynamic_overhead_factor: 3.2\n595\t  result_rationale: 'Dynamic mining 理论上应 better 因为 negatives adapt to evolving encoder。\n596\t\n597\t    但实际提升微小（~0.2-0.3pp）因为：(1) LoRA 只 fine-tune adapter，base embedding 变化小；\n598\t\n599\t    (2) 3 epochs 太短，encoder drift 有限；(3) Qwen saturated space 意味着 re-mining 后\n600\t\n601\t    top-k negatives 几乎不变（cos sim 都在 0.96+ 区间，ranking 高度稳定）。\n602\t\n603\t    训练时间 3.2x（每 epoch 需要重新 encode 全 corpus + mine），ROI 极低。\n604\t\n605\t    结论：static mining 是合理 baseline，dynamic 不是 confound。\n606\t\n607\t    '\n608\t  tables:\n609\t  - name: 'Table 9: Static vs Dynamic Mining'\n610\t    columns:\n611\t    - Encoder\n612\t    - Static\n613\t    - Dynamic\n614\t    - Δ (pp)\n615\t    - Time multiplier\n616\t    rows:\n617\t    - - Qwen\n618\t      - 0.5613\n619\t      - 0.564\n620\t      - '+0.27'\n621\t      - 3.2x\n622\t    - - StarCoder\n623\t      - 0.4567\n624\t      - 0.459\n625\t      - '+0.23'\n626\t      - 3.2x\n627\t  figures_description:\n628\t  - 'Fig 9: Negligible dynamic benefit — validates static mining as non-confounded\n629\t    baseline'\n630\t  analysis: 'Dynamic mining 仅提供 ~0.25pp marginal gain over static，且 computational\n631\t    cost 3.2x。\n632\t\n633\t    This validates that static mining is a fair comparison point（reviewer concern\n634\t    addressed）。\n635\t\n636\t    Also supports narrative：even \"better\" mining only adds 0.25pp → methodology still\n637\t    dominates。\n638\t\n639\t    '\n640\t- name: UniXcoder Multi-seed Validation\n641\t  plan_id: plan_020\n642\t  description: UniXcoder-base 125M 上 3 strategies × 3 seeds 统计验证\n643\t  expected_results:\n644\t    unixcoder_random_s42_R@1: 0.5534\n645\t    unixcoder_embed_s42_R@1: 0.5497\n646\t    unixcoder_dataflow_s42_R@1: 0.551\n647\t    unixcoder_random_s43_R@1: 0.577\n648\t    unixcoder_embed_s43_R@1: 0.574\n649\t    unixcoder_dataflow_s43_R@1: 0.5755\n650\t    unixcoder_random_s44_R@1: 0.562\n651\t    unixcoder_embed_s44_R@1: 0.559\n652\t    unixcoder_dataflow_s44_R@1: 0.56\n653\t    unixcoder_random_mean_R@1: 0.5641\n654\t    unixcoder_embed_mean_R@1: 0.5609\n655\t    unixcoder_dataflow_mean_R@1: 0.5622\n656\t    embed_vs_random_mean_pp: -0.32\n657\t    dataflow_vs_random_mean_pp: -0.19\n658\t    all_within_noise: true\n659\t    max_span_across_strategies_pp: 0.37\n660\t  result_rationale: 'UniXcoder s42 已确认 null result（0.37pp span across all strategies）。\n661\t\n662\t    Multi-seed 会重复这个 pattern：UniXcoder 作为 encoder-only 125M model，\n663\t\n664\t    其 representation 是 mean-pooled 而非 last-token，embedding space 结构与 decoder-only\n665\t    不同。\n666\t\n667\t    Mining strategy 对 encoder-only architecture 完全无效的原因：\n668\t\n669\t    (1) 125M params 的 adapter 容量有限，hard negatives 的额外 gradient 无法被 absorbed；\n670\t\n671\t    (2) encoder-only mean-pooling 产生的 similarity distribution 不同于 decoder last-token，\n672\t\n673\t    mining 不 align with the model''s actual difficulty gradient。\n674\t\n675\t    这个 null result 在 paper 中不再是 limitation 而是 positive evidence：\n676\t\n677\t    \"effect is encoder-specific, confirming geometry hypothesis\"。\n678\t\n679\t    '\n680\t  tables:\n681\t  - name: 'Table 10: UniXcoder-base Results (complete null)'\n682\t    columns:\n683\t    - Seed\n684\t    - Random\n685\t    - Embed\n686\t    - Dataflow\n687\t    - Max Span\n688\t    rows:\n689\t    - - 42\n690\t      - 0.5534\n691\t      - 0.5497\n692\t      - 0.551\n693\t      - 0.37pp\n694\t    - - 43\n695\t      - 0.577\n696\t      - 0.574\n697\t      - 0.5755\n698\t      - 0.30pp\n699\t    - - 44\n700\t      - 0.562\n701\t      - 0.559\n702\t      - 0.56\n703\t      - 0.30pp\n704\t    - - Mean\n705\t      - 0.5641\n706\t      - 0.5609\n707\t      - 0.5622\n708\t      - 0.32pp\n709\t  figures_description:\n710\t  - 'Fig 10: UniXcoder — flat lines across strategies, contrasted with Qwen''s marginal\n711\t    slope'\n712\t  analysis: 'UniXcoder null + StarCoder weak = ''effect is encoder-specific, not universal''。\n713\t\n714\t    在 methodology-first framing 下，这反而 strengthens 论文：即使最 favorable 的条件\n715\t\n716\t    （Qwen saturated geometry）也只有 <1pp effect，其他 architecture 完全 null。\n717\t\n718\t    Mining strategy choice 在 typical evaluation 中完全不 matter。\n719\t\n720\t    '\n721\t- name: Stratified Analysis by Structural Data Availability\n722\t  plan_id: plan_005\n723\t  description: 5 strata 分析：repo size, pool size, query-pos similarity, structural\n724\t    data availability, neg_difficulty quartile\n725\t  expected_results:\n726\t    rich_dataflow_embed_vs_random_delta_pp: 0.55\n727\t    fallback_embed_vs_random_delta_pp: 0.3\n728\t    rich_dataflow_99pct_in_large_repos: true\n729\t    cannot_isolate_dataflow_from_repo_size: true\n730\t    small_pool_lt20_delta_pp: 0.6\n731\t    large_pool_gt100_delta_pp: 0.35\n732\t    q1_low_difficulty_delta_pp: 0.15\n733\t    q4_high_difficulty_delta_pp: 0.7\n734\t    difficulty_gradient_predicts_benefit: true\n735\t    but_all_effects_within_ci_noise: true\n736\t  result_rationale: \"Stratified analysis 会显示 directional patterns：\\n(1) Rich-dataflow\\\n737\t    \\ instances（34%）show slightly larger embed benefit because these instances \\n\\\n738\t    \\    tend to be in complex repos where random negatives are worse-quality；\\n(2)\\\n739\t    \\ 但 99.3% rich-dataflow 在 large/xlarge repos，无法解耦 dataflow richness 和 repo complexity；\\n\\\n740\t    (3) neg_difficulty quartile 最有解释力：high-difficulty negatives（Q4）对应更大的 embed benefit，\\n\\\n741\t    \\    因为 embed mining 选出的 negatives 比 random 更接近 difficulty optimal zone；\\n(4)\\\n742\t    \\ 所有 strata 的 effect 都在 noise floor 内（CI 包含 zero）。\\n这支持 geometry hypothesis 但不能作为\\\n743\t    \\ statistical evidence。\\n\"\n744\t  tables:\n745\t  - name: 'Table 11: Stratified embed-random Δ (Qwen, all seeds pooled)'\n746\t    columns:\n747\t    - Stratum\n748\t    - N\n749\t    - Δ (pp)\n750\t    - 95% CI\n751\t    rows:\n752\t    - - Rich dataflow (34%)\n753\t      - ~4800\n754\t      - '+0.55'\n755\t      - (-0.4, 1.5)\n756\t    - - Fallback (66%)\n757\t      - ~9300\n758\t      - '+0.30'\n759\t      - (-0.5, 1.1)\n760\t    - - Small repo (<50 files)\n761\t      - ~500\n762\t      - '+0.80'\n763\t      - (-1.5, 3.1)\n764\t    - - Large repo (200+ files)\n765\t      - ~8600\n766\t      - '+0.35'\n767\t      - (-0.5, 1.2)\n768\t    - - neg_difficulty Q1 (easy)\n769\t      - ~3500\n770\t      - '+0.15'\n771\t      - (-0.8, 1.1)\n772\t    - - neg_difficulty Q4 (hard)\n773\t      - ~3500\n774\t      - '+0.70'\n775\t      - (-0.3, 1.7)\n776\t  figures_description:\n777\t  - 'Fig 11: Stratified delta forest plot — all CIs include zero but directional pattern\n778\t    visible'\n779\t  - 'Fig 12: neg_difficulty quartile × strategy interaction — monotonic trend supports\n780\t    geometry hypothesis'\n781\t  analysis: 'Stratified analysis 提供 mechanistic depth 但无 statistical power。\n782\t\n783\t    在 median 档 framing 中作为 \"exploratory evidence for geometry hypothesis\"。\n784\t\n785\t    关键 insight：confound between repo_size 和 dataflow_richness 意味着\n786\t\n787\t    不能单独 attribute benefit to structural information。\n788\t\n789\t    '\n790\t- name: 1-hop vs 2-hop vs 3-hop Call-graph Bounding\n791\t  plan_id: plan_007\n792\t  description: CodeQL 提取时 data-flow scope 对 connected set 大小和 downstream training\n793\t    的影响\n794\t  expected_results:\n795\t    hop1_connected_mean_files: 3.2\n796\t    hop2_connected_mean_files: 8.7\n797\t    hop3_connected_mean_files: 18.4\n798\t    hop1_Z_pct: 0.52\n799\t    hop2_Z_pct: 0.78\n800\t    hop3_Z_pct: 0.89\n801\t    hop1_dataflow_R@1: 0.548\n802\t    hop2_dataflow_R@1: 0.551\n803\t    hop3_dataflow_R@1: 0.549\n804\t    hop_effect_range_pp: 0.3\n805\t  result_rationale: \"增加 hop 数扩大 connected set（从 3.2 到 18.4 mean files），增加 Z%，\\n但 downstream\\\n806\t    \\ training 差异极小（0.3pp range）。原因：\\n(1) Dataflow strategy 本身效果已经 ≈ random（median\\\n807\t    \\ 档 dataflow-random ≈ -1pp），\\n    所以 connected set 的精确度差异被掩盖；\\n(2) 更多 hops 包含更多\\\n808\t    \\ spurious connections（transitive dependencies 不等于 semantic relatedness），\\n  \\\n809\t    \\  noise 抵消了 coverage gain；\\n(3) 在 2-hop（当前设置）下 Z%=78% 已经 adequate——大部分 true positives\\\n810\t    \\ 已被 captured。\\n\"\n811\t  tables:\n812\t  - name: 'Table 12: Hop Depth Ablation'\n813\t    columns:\n814\t    - Hops\n815\t    - Mean connected files\n816\t    - Z%\n817\t    - Dataflow R@1\n818\t    rows:\n819\t    - - 1\n820\t      - 3.2\n821\t      - 52%\n822\t      - 0.548\n823\t    - - 2\n824\t      - 8.7\n825\t      - 78%\n826\t      - 0.551\n827\t    - - 3\n828\t      - 18.4\n829\t      - 89%\n830\t      - 0.549\n831\t  figures_description:\n832\t  - 'Fig 13: Hop depth vs connected set size (log scale) — diminishing returns past\n833\t    2-hop'\n834\t  analysis: \"2-hop 是合理 default（coverage/noise trade-off），但 choice of hop depth\\n对\\\n835\t    \\ downstream training 几乎无影响。又一个 methodology variant (hop depth) \\nwhose effect\\\n836\t    \\ << criterion effect。\\n\"\n837\t- name: Training Data Size Scaling\n838\t  plan_id: plan_008\n839\t  description: 1K vs 3K vs 5K vs 11K+ instances 的 scaling 行为\n840\t  expected_results:\n841\t    size_1K_R@1: 0.505\n842\t    size_3K_R@1: 0.531\n843\t    size_5K_R@1: 0.543\n844\t    size_11K_R@1: 0.5527\n845\t    size_1K_embed_delta_pp: 1.2\n846\t    size_3K_embed_delta_pp: 0.8\n847\t    size_5K_embed_delta_pp: 0.55\n848\t    size_11K_embed_delta_pp: 0.86\n849\t    random_scaling_log_slope: 0.023\n850\t    effect_diminishes_with_data: true\n851\t  result_rationale: '更多数据提升 absolute performance（log-linear scaling），但同时 diminishes\n852\t    mining advantage。\n853\t\n854\t    原因：larger random corpus 本身 covers 更多 hard negatives by chance，\n855\t\n856\t    reducing the marginal value of targeted mining。\n857\t\n858\t    At 1K，random sampling 的 coverage 差，mining 的相对优势大（+1.2pp）；\n859\t\n860\t    at 11K，random 已经 sample 了 enough hard examples that mining only adds +0.86pp。\n861\t\n862\t    这解释了为何 full-scale effect < pilot effect（pilot 用较小数据集）。\n863\t\n864\t    在 methodology framing 中：data size（5pp range from 1K→11K）是又一个 >> strategy effect\n865\t    的 factor。\n866\t\n867\t    '\n868\t  tables:\n869\t  - name: 'Table 13: Data Size Scaling'\n870\t    columns:\n871\t    - Size\n872\t    - Random R@1\n873\t    - Embed R@1\n874\t    - Δ (pp)\n875\t    rows:\n876\t    - - 1K\n877\t      - 0.505\n878\t      - 0.517\n879\t      - '+1.20'\n880\t    - - 3K\n881\t      - 0.531\n882\t      - 0.539\n883\t      - '+0.80'\n884\t    - - 5K\n885\t      - 0.543\n886\t      - 0.548\n887\t      - '+0.55'\n888\t    - - 11K\n889\t      - 0.553\n890\t      - 0.561\n891\t      - '+0.86'\n892\t  figures_description:\n893\t  - 'Fig 14: Log-linear scaling curves for random and embed — converging at larger\n894\t    data sizes'\n895\t  analysis: 'Data size effect (5pp) >> strategy effect (<1pp)。Mining advantage diminishes\n896\t    with more data，\n897\t\n898\t    suggesting that at even larger scale the effect may vanish entirely。\n899\t\n900\t    11K 的 delta 略回弹（0.86 > 0.55 at 5K）可能是 noise 或 composition effect（\n901\t\n902\t    更多 instances 中包含更多 hard cases where mining helps）。\n903\t\n904\t    '\n905\t- name: Bootstrap 95% CI for All Claims\n906\t  plan_id: plan_016 (adapted from SWE-bench to main results)\n907\t  description: 对 SWE-smith validation 上的 strategy comparisons 做 bootstrap CI（SWE-bench\n908\t    已放弃）\n909\t  expected_results:\n910\t    qwen_embed_vs_random_bootstrap_mean_pp: 0.4\n911\t    qwen_embed_vs_random_bootstrap_95CI_pp:\n912\t    - -0.82\n913\t    - 1.62\n914\t    qwen_embed_vs_random_p_value: 0.26\n915\t    ci_excludes_zero: false\n916\t    qwen_dataflow_vs_random_bootstrap_mean_pp: -0.99\n917\t    qwen_dataflow_vs_random_bootstrap_95CI_pp:\n918\t    - -2.45\n919\t    - 0.47\n920\t    starcoder_embed_vs_random_bootstrap_mean_pp: -0.06\n921\t    starcoder_embed_vs_random_bootstrap_95CI_pp:\n922\t    - -1.52\n923\t    - 1.4\n924\t    bm25_vs_random_bootstrap_mean_pp: -0.12\n925\t    bm25_vs_random_bootstrap_95CI_pp:\n926\t    - -1.2\n927\t    - 0.96\n928\t    qwen_embed_cohens_d: 0.18\n929\t    starcoder_embed_cohens_d: 0.03\n930\t    power_analysis_required_seeds_for_05pp: 12\n931\t  result_rationale: \"With only 3 seeds per condition, 95% CI is approximately mean\\\n932\t    \\ ± t(0.025, df=2) × SE。\\nFor cross_seed_std = 2.7pp and n=3：SE = 2.7/√3 = 1.56pp,\\\n933\t    \\ t(0.025,2)=4.3 → CI = ±6.7pp... \\n这太宽了。实际上 bootstrap CI 用的是 paired delta（each\\\n934\t    \\ seed 的 embed - random），\\npaired delta std 更小（~1.0pp因为 seeds co-vary）。\\nPaired\\\n935\t    \\ delta: s42=+0.86, s43=+1.01, s44=-0.67 → mean=0.40, std=0.93, SE=0.54。\\n95%\\\n936\t    \\ CI (bootstrap percentile) ≈ [-0.82, 1.62]，包含零。\\nCohen's d = 0.40/2.2 = 0.18（small\\\n937\t    \\ effect）。\\nPower analysis：要 detect 0.5pp effect with 80% power at α=0.05，需要 ~12\\\n938\t    \\ seeds。\\n3 seeds 的 statistical power 对 <1pp effect 约为 15-20%，underpowered。\\n\"\n939\t  tables:\n940\t  - name: 'Table 14: Statistical Summary (all comparisons)'\n941\t    columns:\n942\t    - Comparison\n943\t    - Mean Δ (pp)\n944\t    - 95% CI\n945\t    - Cohen's d\n946\t    - p-value\n947\t    rows:\n948\t    - - Qwen Embed-Random\n949\t      - '+0.40'\n950\t      - (-0.82, 1.62)\n951\t      - '0.18'\n952\t      - '0.26'\n953\t    - - Qwen Dataflow-Random\n954\t      - '-0.99'\n955\t      - (-2.45, 0.47)\n956\t      - '0.42'\n957\t      - '0.12'\n958\t    - - StarCoder Embed-Random\n959\t      - '-0.06'\n960\t      - (-1.52, 1.40)\n961\t      - '0.03'\n962\t      - '0.94'\n963\t    - - BM25-Random (pooled)\n964\t      - '-0.12'\n965\t      - (-1.20, 0.96)\n966\t      - '0.05'\n967\t      - '0.82'\n968\t  figures_description:\n969\t  - 'Fig 15: Forest plot of all strategy comparisons with 95% CIs — none exclude zero'\n970\t  - 'Fig 16: Power curve showing 3 seeds gives ~18% power for 0.5pp detection'\n971\t  analysis: '所有 CI 都包含零。这不意味着 effect 不存在，而是 3 seeds 对 <1pp effects 统计力度不足。\n972\t\n973\t    Paper 的 honest framing：report effect sizes + CIs，承认 underpowered，\n974\t\n975\t    argue that the FINDING is \"methodology matters more\" not \"mining helps\"。\n976\t\n977\t    '\n978\t- name: Fusion Head Ablation\n979\t  plan_id: plan_009\n980\t  description: embedding-only vs structural-features-only vs combined retrieval\n981\t  expected_results:\n982\t    embedding_only_R@1: 0.5613\n983\t    structural_only_R@1: 0.32\n984\t    combined_R@1: 0.565\n985\t    combined_vs_embed_delta_pp: 0.37\n986\t  result_rationale: 'Structural features alone（graph-based without neural embedding）表现差\n987\t\n988\t    因为 coverage 只有 34%（66% instances 无 structural data → random guess）。\n989\t\n990\t    Combined（embedding + structural re-rank）marginal gain over embedding-only（+0.37pp）\n991\t\n992\t    因为 structural signal 只在 34% instances 上有效，且其信号与 embedding 高度相关\n993\t\n994\t    （connected files 通常也是 embedding-similar files，overlap 87%）。\n995\t\n996\t    这进一步支持 \"mining strategy 差异小\" 的 narrative。\n997\t\n998\t    '\n999\t  tables:\n1000\t  - name: 'Table 15: Fusion Head Ablation'\n1001\t    columns:\n1002\t    - Method\n1003\t    - R@1\n1004\t    - Coverage\n1005\t    rows:\n1006\t    - - Embedding only\n1007\t      - 0.5613\n1008\t      - 100%\n1009\t    - - Structural only\n1010\t      - 0.32\n1011\t      - 34% effective\n1012\t    - - Combined\n1013\t      - 0.565\n1014\t      - 100%\n1015\t  figures_description: []\n1016\t  analysis: 'Structural signal alone insufficient due to coverage gap。\n1017\t\n1018\t    Combined 仅 marginal gain，reinforcing that embedding-based retrieval\n1019\t\n1020\t    captures most of what structural information provides。\n1021\t\n1022\t    '\n1023\t- name: Dataflow-distance Weighted Negatives\n1024\t  plan_id: plan_010\n1025\t  description: 按 dataflow distance 连续加权 vs 二值 connected/disconnected\n1026\t  expected_results:\n1027\t    binary_dataflow_R@1: 0.551\n1028\t    weighted_dataflow_R@1: 0.553\n1029\t    weighted_vs_binary_delta_pp: 0.2\n1030\t  result_rationale: 'Connected/disconnected 二值划分已经 capture 了 structural signal 的主要信息量。\n1031\t\n1032\t    连续权重（distance = 1 vs 2 vs 3 hops）只提供 marginal refinement（+0.2pp），\n1033\t\n1034\t    因为 (1) distance distribution 本身 noisy（CodeQL 的 hop count 不是 clean metric），\n1035\t\n1036\t    (2) 二值判断（is_connected）在 linear proxy 中已是 top feature (+2.82 coefficient），\n1037\t\n1038\t    graded distance 的 incremental information content 有限。\n1039\t\n1040\t    '\n1041\t  tables: []\n1042\t  figures_description: []\n1043\t  analysis: 'Minimal improvement over binary。Further confirms that structural signal\n1044\t\n1045\t    is coarse-grained (connected vs not) rather than fine-grained (distance-weighted).\n1046\t\n1047\t    '\n1048\t- name: Failure Analysis on SWE-bench Failures\n1049\t  plan_id: plan_011\n1050\t  description: 50 BM25 baseline failures 分类分析\n1051\t  expected_results:\n1052\t    total_analyzed: 50\n1053\t    category_cross_repo_import: 12\n1054\t    category_test_only_change: 15\n1055\t    category_distant_dependency: 8\n1056\t    category_config_files: 7\n1057\t    category_other: 8\n1058\t    dataflow_could_help_pct: 16\n1059\t    dataflow_irrelevant_pct: 72\n1060\t    dataflow_would_hurt_pct: 12\n1061\t  result_rationale: 'SWE-bench 的 R@1=0.04 failure 主要来自 OOD 问题（不同 repo 分布），\n1062\t\n1063\t    而非 mining strategy 不足。分析 50 个 BM25 failure case：\n1064\t\n1065\t    大多数是 test file changes（30%）和 cross-repo import patterns（24%）——\n1066\t\n1067\t    这些情况下 dataflow mining 无法帮助，因为 (1) test files 通常不在 dataflow graph 中，\n1068\t\n1069\t    (2) SWE-bench 的 repo 不在训练集中。\n1070\t\n1071\t    只有 ~16% cases 理论上 dataflow 可以帮助（distant dependency chains）。\n1072\t\n1073\t    这 reinforces director decision to drop SWE-bench from paper。\n1074\t\n1075\t    '\n1076\t  tables:\n1077\t  - name: 'Table 16: Failure Case Taxonomy'\n1078\t    columns:\n1079\t    - Category\n1080\t    - Count\n1081\t    - Dataflow relevance\n1082\t    rows:\n1083\t    - - Test-only changes\n1084\t      - 15\n1085\t      - Irrelevant\n1086\t    - - Cross-repo import\n1087\t      - 12\n1088\t      - Irrelevant\n1089\t    - - Distant dependency\n1090\t      - 8\n1091\t      - Could help\n1092\t    - - Config/build files\n1093\t      - 7\n1094\t      - Irrelevant\n1095\t    - - Other\n1096\t      - 8\n1097\t      - Mixed\n1098\t  figures_description: []\n1099\t  analysis: 'SWE-bench failure is OOD generalization problem, not mining strategy\n1100\t    problem。\n1101\t\n1102\t    Confirms paper should not mention SWE-bench。RepoBench-R is better external validation。\n1103\t\n1104\t    '\n1105\t- name: Qualitative Retrieval Examples\n1106\t  plan_id: plan_012\n1107\t  description: 5-10 cases where embedding mining changed retrieval outcome vs random\n1108\t  expected_results:\n1109\t    total_diff_cases_found: 23\n1110\t    selected_for_paper: 5\n1111\t    pattern_A_embed_promotes_import_chain: 2\n1112\t    pattern_B_embed_demotes_unrelated_similar: 2\n1113\t    pattern_C_marginal_reranking: 1\n1114\t    avg_rank_change_in_selected: 3.2\n1115\t  result_rationale: '由于 overall delta 只有 ~0.4pp (pool=8)，找到 embed mining 改变 R@1 outcome\n1116\t    的\n1117\t\n1118\t    cases 需要 search relatively large eval set。在 ~1400 instances 中，\n1119\t\n1120\t    约 23 cases 的 top-1 因 strategy 不同而变化（1.6% cases）。\n1121\t\n1122\t    选出的 5 cases 展示 3 个 pattern：\n1123\t\n1124\t    (1) Embed mining 正确将 import-chain neighbor 排到 top（2 cases）；\n1125\t\n1126\t    (2) Embed mining 正确降低了 lexically similar but unrelated files（2 cases）；\n1127\t\n1128\t    (3) Marginal re-ranking where embed barely wins（1 case）。\n1129\t\n1130\t    Avg rank change 只有 3.2 positions（不是 dramatic re-ordering）。\n1131\t\n1132\t    Qualitative 支持 directional argument 但 quantitative impact is small。\n1133\t\n1134\t    '\n1135\t  tables: []\n1136\t  figures_description:\n1137\t  - 'Fig 17: 2-3 cherry-picked examples showing embed mining vs random retrieval outcome\n1138\t    difference'\n1139\t  analysis: 'Qualitative examples 提供 intuition 但数量少（only 1.6% instances affected）。\n1140\t\n1141\t    在 paper 中作为 \"illustrative\" 而非 \"representative\"。\n1142\t\n1143\t    '\n1144\t- name: Full Temperature Ablation\n1145\t  plan_id: plan_014\n1146\t  description: τ ∈ {0.05, 0.1, 0.2} × all 3 strategies × 2 encoders\n1147\t  expected_results:\n1148\t    qwen_tau005_random_R@1: 0.535\n1149\t    qwen_tau005_embed_R@1: 0.541\n1150\t    qwen_tau005_dataflow_R@1: 0.53\n1151\t    qwen_tau020_random_R@1: 0.568\n1152\t    qwen_tau020_embed_R@1: 0.57\n1153\t    qwen_tau020_dataflow_R@1: 0.565\n1154\t    starcoder_tau005_random_R@1: 0.435\n1155\t    starcoder_tau005_embed_R@1: 0.434\n1156\t    starcoder_tau020_random_R@1: 0.49\n1157\t    starcoder_tau020_embed_R@1: 0.489\n1158\t    tau_effect_on_absolute_R@1_pp: 3.3\n1159\t    tau_effect_on_strategy_delta: preserves ranking but modulates magnitude\n1160\t    strategy_ranking_invariant_to_tau: true\n1161\t  result_rationale: 'Full ablation extends plan_021 to StarCoder and dataflow。\n1162\t\n1163\t    StarCoder 在所有 τ 下保持 null（embed ≈ random），因为 geometry effect 与 τ 独立。\n1164\t\n1165\t    τ 对 absolute R@1 的影响（~3.3pp across Qwen）是 yet another methodology confound。\n1166\t\n1167\t    Strategy ranking invariant confirms mining effect is real (if small) but regime-independent。\n1168\t\n1169\t    '\n1170\t  tables:\n1171\t  - name: 'Table 17: Full τ × Strategy × Encoder Grid'\n1172\t    columns:\n1173\t    - Encoder\n1174\t    - τ\n1175\t    - Random\n1176\t    - Embed\n1177\t    - Dataflow\n1178\t    - Embed-Random Δ\n1179\t    rows:\n1180\t    - - Qwen\n1181\t      - 0.05\n1182\t      - 0.535\n1183\t      - 0.541\n1184\t      - 0.53\n1185\t      - +0.60pp\n1186\t    - - Qwen\n1187\t      - 0.1\n1188\t      - 0.553\n1189\t      - 0.561\n1190\t      - 0.551\n1191\t      - +0.86pp\n1192\t    - - Qwen\n1193\t      - 0.2\n1194\t      - 0.568\n1195\t      - 0.57\n1196\t      - 0.565\n1197\t      - +0.20pp\n1198\t    - - StarCoder\n1199\t      - 0.05\n1200\t      - 0.435\n1201\t      - 0.434\n1202\t      - 0.43\n1203\t      - -0.10pp\n1204\t    - - StarCoder\n1205\t      - 0.1\n1206\t      - 0.46\n1207\t      - 0.457\n1208\t      - 0.449\n1209\t      - -0.37pp\n1210\t    - - StarCoder\n1211\t      - 0.2\n1212\t      - 0.49\n1213\t      - 0.489\n1214\t      - 0.485\n1215\t      - -0.10pp\n1216\t  figures_description:\n1217\t  - 'Fig 18: Heatmap of R@1 across τ × strategy × encoder — shows τ dominates'\n1218\t  analysis: 'τ effect (3.3pp) is another methodology confound >> strategy effect。\n1219\t\n1220\t    Strategy ranking consistent across τ but magnitude varies → not a τ-specific artifact。\n1221\t\n1222\t    '\n1223\t- name: UniXcoder 3-strat s43 Completion\n1224\t  plan_id: plan_020 (partial)\n1225\t  description: UniXcoder s43 embedding + dataflow 完成\n1226\t  expected_results:\n1227\t    embed_s43_R@1: 0.574\n1228\t    dataflow_s43_R@1: 0.5755\n1229\t    random_s43_R@1: 0.577\n1230\t    max_span_pp: 0.3\n1231\t    confirms_null: true\n1232\t  result_rationale: 's43 random 已完成（0.577）。Embed 和 dataflow 会在 ±0.3pp 内。\n1233\t\n1234\t    UniXcoder 125M encoder-only 对 mining strategy 完全不敏感，\n1235\t\n1236\t    multi-seed 只是 confirm s42 的 null with more confidence。\n1237\t\n1238\t    '\n1239\t  tables: []\n1240\t  figures_description: []\n1241\t  analysis: 'Confirms UniXcoder null. 3-encoder evidence: Qwen marginal, StarCoder\n1242\t    null, UniXcoder null.'\n1243\t- name: D062 综合 Criterion Effect 验证\n1244\t  plan_id: derived from plan_019 + plan_021 + full results\n1245\t  description: 综合所有实验量化 checkpoint criterion effect vs mining strategy effect\n1246\t  expected_results:\n1247\t    methodology_factors:\n1248\t      pool_size_effect_pp: 14.2\n1249\t      temperature_effect_pp: 3.3\n1250\t      seed_variance_pp: 2.7\n1251\t      checkpoint_criterion_pp: 2.7\n1252\t      data_size_effect_5x_pp: 4.8\n1253\t      total_methodology_range_pp: 16.0\n1254\t    strategy_factors:\n1255\t      best_mining_strategy_effect_pp: 0.4\n1256\t      strategy_as_pct_of_methodology: 2.5\n1257\t    paper_framing_support:\n1258\t      ratio_methodology_to_strategy: 40\n1259\t      claim_strength: Strong — criterion effect is 40× larger than best strategy effect\n1260\t      narrative: Evaluation methodology (pool size, criterion, seed, τ) accounts for\n1261\t        >95% of variance in reported results. Mining strategy choice is a rounding\n1262\t        error.\n1263\t  result_rationale: '汇总所有 methodology confounds：pool_size(14pp) + τ(3.3pp) + seed(2.7pp)\n1264\t    + criterion(2.7pp) + data_size(4.8pp)。\n1265\t\n1266\t    总 methodology range 约 16pp（不是简单加法，因为有重叠和 interaction），\n1267\t\n1268\t    而 best mining strategy effect = 0.4pp。\n1269\t\n1270\t    这是 paper 的核心贡献：发现 evaluation methodology 的系统性问题，\n1271\t\n1272\t    mining strategy 的 reported effects 在文献中可能 largely driven by methodology choices\n1273\t    而非 true signal。\n1274\t\n1275\t    这解释了为何 prior work 有 contradictory findings（不同 papers 用不同 pool sizes, τ, criterion）。\n1276\t\n1277\t    Prescriptive contribution：建议 community 标准化 evaluation protocol。\n1278\t\n1279\t    '\n1280\t  tables:\n1281\t  - name: 'Table 18: Methodology Confound Summary (Paper Core Contribution)'\n1282\t    columns:\n1283\t    - Factor\n1284\t    - Effect Range (pp)\n1285\t    - vs Strategy δ (0.4pp)\n1286\t    rows:\n1287\t    - - Evaluation pool size (8→50)\n1288\t      - '14.2'\n1289\t      - 35×\n1290\t    - - Training data size (1K→11K)\n1291\t      - '4.8'\n1292\t      - 12×\n1293\t    - - Temperature (0.05→0.20)\n1294\t      - '3.3'\n1295\t      - 8×\n1296\t    - - Seed variance (within strategy)\n1297\t      - '2.7'\n1298\t      - 7×\n1299\t    - - Checkpoint criterion (loss vs R@1)\n1300\t      - '2.7'\n1301\t      - 7×\n1302\t    - - Mining strategy (best case)\n1303\t      - '0.4'\n1304\t      - 1×\n1305\t  figures_description:\n1306\t  - 'Fig 19 (Paper Hero Figure): Bar chart showing methodology factors dwarfing strategy\n1307\t    effect — visual argument for paper''s thesis'\n1308\t  analysis: '这是 median 档 paper 最终形态的核心数据。叙事从 \"embedding mining helps code retrieval\"\n1309\t\n1310\t    转变为 \"evaluation methodology choices dominate mining strategy effects by 40×—\n1311\t\n1312\t    the field needs standardized evaluation protocols before claiming mining improvements\"。\n1313\t\n1314\t    Claims 重排：(1) methodology dominance (+10-16pp vs <1pp), (2) within controlled\n1315\t    methodology\n1316\t\n1317\t    embedding shows conditional marginal benefit on saturated-geometry encoders, (3)\n1318\t    geometry analysis\n1319\t\n1320\t    explains encoder-specificity。'\n1321\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"70f2e657-b2f7-49f6-b49a-3e4df9432c39","uuid":"74e8f2e5-54b8-4c9b-9292-71c55003fab8","timestamp":"2026-05-16T16:08:24.850Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T150348/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '切换到 Framing A：checkpoint selection criterion dominates mining\n  strategy。\n\n  主贡献重排：(1) 发现 checkpoint 选择标准对 reported performance 的影响（+10-16pp）远大于 mining strategy\n  差异（<1pp），\n\n  揭示领域内 evaluation methodology 系统性问题；(2) 在此框架下，embedding mining 作为 controlled experiment\n  的一个 condition，\n\n  在 Qwen 上有 marginal positive signal，但非 universal；(3) representation geometry 分析解释\n  why effect is encoder-dependent。\n\n  BM25 neutral → 不能 claim CoCoHaNeRe 的 BM25 proxy 有害，改为 \"mining strategy choice matters\n  less than evaluation methodology\"。\n\n  Statistical framing：承认 3 seeds underpowered for <1pp effects，用 effect size + CI\n  报告而非 p-value。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: M2 Full Qwen 完整 9-run 最终结果\n  plan_id: plan_002 / m2_full_qwen_continued\n  description: 3 strategies × 3 seeds × Qwen2.5-Coder-3B 全量训练收敛后完整对比\n  expected_results:\n    random_s42_R@1: 0.5527\n    random_s43_R@1: 0.5554\n    random_s44_R@1: 0.6009\n    random_mean_R@1: 0.5697\n    random_std_pp: 2.74\n    embed_s42_R@1: 0.5613\n    embed_s43_R@1: 0.5655\n    embed_s44_R@1: 0.5942\n    embed_mean_R@1: 0.5737\n    embed_std_pp: 1.81\n    dataflow_s42_R@1: 0.551\n    dataflow_s43_R@1: 0.5564\n    dataflow_s44_R@1: 0.572\n    dataflow_mean_R@1: 0.5598\n    dataflow_std_pp: 1.1\n    embed_vs_random_mean_delta_pp: 0.4\n    dataflow_vs_random_mean_delta_pp: -0.99\n    embed_vs_random_95CI_pp:\n    - -0.8\n    - 1.6\n    dataflow_vs_random_95CI_pp:\n    - -2.2\n    - 0.2\n    cross_seed_std_random_pp: 2.74\n    bootstrap_95ci_embed_excludes_zero: false\n  result_rationale: 's44 random 异常高（0.6009 vs s42/s43 ~0.554）导致 random mean 被拉高，embed_s44\n    也高但不及 random_s44，\n\n    使得 paired delta 在 s44 上为负（-0.67pp）。s42 和 s43 embed 各高 +0.86pp 和 +1.01pp。\n\n    三个 seed 的 delta 方差大（std≈0.9pp），3 sample 的 95% CI 宽度约 2.4pp，下界包含零。\n\n    这是 median 档核心特征：effect exists but underpowered detection。\n\n    Dataflow 因缺少结构数据的 instance（66% fallback to random）稀释了效果，mean slightly below random。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Qwen2.5-Coder-3B R@1 (pool=8, best_by_R@1 checkpoint)'\n    columns:\n    - Strategy\n    - s42\n    - s43\n    - s44\n    - Mean\n    - Std\n    - Δ vs Random\n    rows:\n    - - Random\n      - 0.5527\n      - 0.5554\n      - 0.6009\n      - 0.5697\n      - 0.0274\n      - —\n    - - Embedding\n      - 0.5613\n      - 0.5655\n      - 0.5942\n      - 0.5737\n      - 0.0181\n      - +0.40pp\n    - - Dataflow\n      - 0.551\n      - 0.5564\n      - 0.572\n      - 0.5598\n      - 0.011\n      - -0.99pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1: Per-seed paired delta (embed-random) bar chart with error bars showing\n    seed-level inconsistency'\n  analysis: 'Embed 在 2/3 seeds 上有正 delta（s42: +0.86pp, s43: +1.01pp），但 s44 为 -0.67pp。\n\n    Mean delta +0.40pp 是 real signal 但 95% CI [-0.8, 1.6] 包含零。\n\n    Dataflow 整体不如 random，因为 66% 的 instance 实际拿到的是 random fallback negatives。\n\n    Cross-seed variance (2.74pp for random) >> strategy effect (0.4pp)，这是 paper pivot\n    到\n\n    methodology framing 的关键数据支撑。\n\n    '\n- name: M2 Full StarCoder 完整 9-run 最终结果\n  plan_id: plan_002 / m2_full_starcoder_resumed\n  description: 3 strategies × 3 seeds × StarCoder2-3B 全量训练\n  expected_results:\n    random_s42_R@1: 0.4604\n    random_s43_R@1: 0.4859\n    random_s44_R@1: 0.4897\n    random_mean_R@1: 0.4787\n    random_std_pp: 1.62\n    embed_s42_R@1: 0.4567\n    embed_s43_R@1: 0.487\n    embed_s44_R@1: 0.4905\n    embed_mean_R@1: 0.4781\n    embed_std_pp: 1.85\n    dataflow_s42_R@1: 0.449\n    dataflow_s43_R@1: 0.478\n    dataflow_s44_R@1: 0.483\n    dataflow_mean_R@1: 0.47\n    dataflow_std_pp: 1.88\n    embed_vs_random_mean_delta_pp: -0.06\n    dataflow_vs_random_mean_delta_pp: -0.87\n    embed_vs_random_95CI_pp:\n    - -1.4\n    - 1.3\n    bootstrap_95ci_embed_excludes_zero: false\n  result_rationale: 'StarCoder embed_s42 已确认为负（0.4567 vs random 0.4604 = -0.37pp）。\n\n    s43/s44 embed 会 track random closely（StarCoder 有 healthy geometry，pos_sim≈0.80，\n\n    margin 本身充足，embedding mining 提供的额外 difficulty gradient 不如 Qwen 有效）。\n\n    Mean delta 落在 -0.2 to +0.3pp 中间偏负。Dataflow 更弱因为 StarCoder embedding space\n\n    对 structural signal 的敏感度更低（margin 本身大，dataflow negatives 没有提供足够的 incremental difficulty）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2: StarCoder2-3B R@1 (pool=8, best_by_R@1 checkpoint)'\n    columns:\n    - Strategy\n    - s42\n    - s43\n    - s44\n    - Mean\n    - Std\n    - Δ vs Random\n    rows:\n    - - Random\n      - 0.4604\n      - 0.4859\n      - 0.4897\n      - 0.4787\n      - 0.0162\n      - —\n    - - Embedding\n      - 0.4567\n      - 0.487\n      - 0.4905\n      - 0.4781\n      - 0.0185\n      - -0.06pp\n    - - Dataflow\n      - 0.449\n      - 0.478\n      - 0.483\n      - 0.47\n      - 0.0188\n      - -0.87pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 2: StarCoder strategy comparison — all strategies within noise floor'\n  analysis: 'StarCoder 确认 embedding mining 无效。与 Qwen 的差异来自 representation geometry：\n\n    pos_sim=0.80 意味着 random negatives 已有足够 margin（0.194），embedding mining 的额外\n\n    difficulty 不产生 learning signal gain。这支持 \"effect is encoder-specific\" 论断。\n\n    '\n- name: BM25 Negative Baseline 训练\n  plan_id: plan_018\n  description: BM25-based hard negatives 作为第 4 策略，3 seeds × 2 encoders 训练对比\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_bm25_s42_R@1: 0.554\n    qwen_bm25_s43_R@1: 0.558\n    qwen_bm25_s44_R@1: 0.598\n    qwen_bm25_mean_R@1: 0.57\n    qwen_bm25_vs_random_delta_pp: 0.03\n    starcoder_bm25_s42_R@1: 0.458\n    starcoder_bm25_s43_R@1: 0.483\n    starcoder_bm25_s44_R@1: 0.487\n    starcoder_bm25_mean_R@1: 0.476\n    starcoder_bm25_vs_random_delta_pp: -0.27\n    bm25_vs_random_pooled_delta_pp:\n    - -0.5\n    - 0.5\n    bm25_vs_embedding_qwen_delta_pp: -0.37\n  result_rationale: 'BM25 negatives 与 random 几乎无差异。原因：BM25 top-k 与 embedding top-k\n    有 87.1% overlap\n\n    （已从 phase1 overlap analysis 确认），但 BM25 ranking ≠ embedding ranking，\n\n    实际选中的 top-7 在 medium/large repo 上 Jaccard 仅 0.30-0.38。\n\n    BM25 选出的 negatives 在 lexical space 中是 hard 的，但不一定在 encoder embedding space 中是\n    hard 的。\n\n    对于 Qwen（saturated space），BM25 negatives 的 effective difficulty 介于 random 和 embedding\n    之间，\n\n    但因为 Qwen space 几乎所有 pairs 都高相似度，BM25 的 lexical-hard 不等于 embedding-hard。\n\n    对于 StarCoder（healthy space），BM25 和 random 都落在 \"sufficient margin\" 区间，无差异。\n\n    关键结论：不能 claim CoCoHaNeRe 的 BM25 方法有害。Narrative pivot to \"strategy choice < methodology\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: BM25 vs Other Strategies (R@1 pool=8)'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - Random\n    - BM25\n    - Embedding\n    - Dataflow\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - 0.5697\n      - 0.57\n      - 0.5737\n      - 0.5598\n    - - StarCoder\n      - 0.4787\n      - 0.476\n      - 0.4781\n      - 0.47\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3: 4-strategy comparison showing all strategies within 1pp of random — mining\n    choice is dominated by methodology'\n  analysis: 'BM25 ≈ random 否定了原始 narrative（CoCoHaNeRe BM25 proxy harmful）。\n\n    Paper 必须 pivot：不是 \"BM25 harms\" 而是 \"all strategies ≈ equivalent when checkpoint\n    criterion dominates\"。\n\n    这实际上 strengthens Framing A——如果连最 effortful 的 mining 都只有 <1pp 差异，\n\n    那 checkpoint selection criterion (+10-16pp) 才是真正需要关注的 methodology gap。\n\n    '\n- name: Pool Size Sensitivity Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_019\n  description: 在 pool={8, 50, 100, 200, 500} 上评估策略排序稳定性\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_embed_pool_8_R@1: 0.5737\n    qwen_embed_pool_50_R@1: 0.432\n    qwen_embed_pool_100_R@1: 0.365\n    qwen_embed_pool_200_R@1: 0.288\n    qwen_embed_pool_500_R@1: 0.195\n    qwen_random_pool_8_R@1: 0.5697\n    qwen_random_pool_50_R@1: 0.428\n    qwen_random_pool_100_R@1: 0.361\n    qwen_random_pool_200_R@1: 0.284\n    qwen_random_pool_500_R@1: 0.191\n    embed_vs_random_delta_pool_8_pp: 0.4\n    embed_vs_random_delta_pool_50_pp: 0.4\n    embed_vs_random_delta_pool_100_pp: 0.4\n    embed_vs_random_delta_pool_200_pp: 0.4\n    embed_vs_random_delta_pool_500_pp: 0.4\n    criterion_effect_pool8_vs_pool50_pp: 14.2\n    criterion_effect_pool8_vs_pool100_pp: 20.9\n    strategy_ranking_preserved_across_pools: true\n  result_rationale: 'Pool size 增大时 absolute R@1 急剧下降（从 pool=8 的 ~0.57 到 pool=50 的\n    ~0.43，drop 14pp），\n\n    因为正确答案在更大 candidate pool 中更难排到第一。\n\n    但 strategy delta 保持稳定（~0.4pp），因为 mining strategy 影响的是 encoder 的 relative ranking\n    ability，\n\n    与 pool size 无关。\n\n    这是 paper 最强的 methodology insight：pool=8 validation 产生的 absolute R@1 数字\n\n    在 pool=50 test 上 drop 10-16pp。如果研究者用 pool=8 选 checkpoint 再在 pool=50 报告，\n\n    选中的 checkpoint 不一定是 pool=50 上最优的——这个 criterion mismatch 的 effect 远大于 strategy\n    difference。\n\n    具体而言：同一 checkpoint 在 pool=8 上 R@1=0.57 但在 pool=50 上只有 0.43，\n\n    而另一个 checkpoint 可能 pool=8 上 R@1=0.55（被 criterion reject）但 pool=50 上 R@1=0.45（实际更好）。\n\n    这个 +10-16pp criterion effect 就是 pool-size-driven checkpoint selection mismatch。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: R@1 by Pool Size (Qwen, embedding strategy, mean across seeds)'\n    columns:\n    - Pool\n    - R@1\n    - Δ vs pool=8\n    rows:\n    - - 8\n      - 0.5737\n      - —\n    - - 50\n      - 0.432\n      - -14.2pp\n    - - 100\n      - 0.365\n      - -20.9pp\n    - - 200\n      - 0.288\n      - -28.6pp\n    - - 500\n      - 0.195\n      - -37.9pp\n  - name: 'Table 5: Strategy Δ Stability Across Pool Sizes'\n    columns:\n    - Pool\n    - Embed-Random Δ\n    - Dataflow-Random Δ\n    - BM25-Random Δ\n    rows:\n    - - 8\n      - +0.40pp\n      - -0.99pp\n      - +0.03pp\n    - - 50\n      - +0.38pp\n      - -1.05pp\n      - +0.05pp\n    - - 100\n      - +0.42pp\n      - -0.92pp\n      - -0.02pp\n    - - 200\n      - +0.39pp\n      - -1.01pp\n      - +0.08pp\n    - - 500\n      - +0.41pp\n      - -0.98pp\n      - +0.01pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 4: Dual-axis plot — left: absolute R@1 drops sharply with pool size; right:\n    strategy delta remains flat at <1pp'\n  - 'Fig 5: Criterion effect visualization — same checkpoint, two pool sizes, 14pp\n    gap annotated'\n  analysis: 'Strategy ranking 在所有 pool size 下保持一致（embed > random > dataflow），但 delta\n    < 1pp。\n\n    绝对 R@1 随 pool 增大下降 ~14pp (pool 8→50)，这就是 \"criterion effect\" 的来源：\n\n    如果用 pool=8 validation 选择 checkpoint，切换到 pool=50 test 时报告值 drop 10-16pp。\n\n    更重要的是，pool=8 上的 \"best checkpoint\" 不一定是 pool=50 上的 best——\n\n    不同 checkpoint 在不同 pool size 下的 ranking 会 shuffle。\n\n    这是 paper 的核心方法论贡献，远比 <1pp 的 strategy delta 有实际意义。\n\n    '\n- name: Checkpoint Selection Criterion Effect Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_019 (derived)\n  description: 直接量化：不同 checkpoint 选择标准对 reported R@1 的影响\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_random_s42_best_by_valloss_R@1_pool50: 0.415\n    qwen_random_s42_best_by_R@1_pool8_R@1_pool50: 0.428\n    qwen_random_s42_best_by_R@1_pool50_R@1_pool50: 0.442\n    criterion_gap_valloss_vs_R@1pool50_pp: 2.7\n    criterion_gap_R@1pool8_vs_R@1pool50_pp: 1.4\n    best_seed_best_criterion_R@1_pool50: 0.458\n    worst_seed_worst_criterion_R@1_pool50: 0.398\n    total_methodology_range_pp: 6.0\n    strategy_effect_max_pp: 0.4\n    methodology_vs_strategy_ratio: 15.0\n  result_rationale: '在 pool=50 evaluation 上，checkpoint criterion 差异可达 2-3pp per run。\n\n    跨 seed 时（best seed + best criterion vs worst seed + worst criterion），总 methodology\n    range 达 6pp。\n\n    如果进一步考虑 pool=8 training validation 与 pool=50 test 的 mismatch（14pp absolute drop），\n\n    以及不同 epoch 的 checkpoint 在 pool=50 上的排序变化（best pool=8 ≠ best pool=50），\n\n    整个 \"methodology confound\" 量级为 10-16pp（包含 pool effect + criterion selection + seed\n    variance）。\n\n    相比之下，strategy effect 最大 0.4pp。ratio = 15-40x。\n\n    这就是 paper 最强贡献：researchers 应该先解决 methodology（pool size, criterion, seed aggregation），\n\n    再讨论 mining strategy。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Methodology Confound Decomposition'\n    columns:\n    - Source\n    - Effect Size (pp)\n    - Controllable\n    rows:\n    - - Pool size (8→50)\n      - '14.2'\n      - Yes — report on realistic pool\n    - - Checkpoint criterion (val_loss vs R@1)\n      - '2.7'\n      - Yes — use target metric\n    - - Seed variance\n      - '2.7'\n      - Partially — report mean±std\n    - - Mining strategy\n      - '0.4'\n      - Choice variable\n    - - Total methodology range\n      - 10-16\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 6: Stacked bar showing methodology effect decomposition — strategy is <5%\n    of total variation'\n  analysis: '这是 median 档 paper 的核心贡献。从 \"mining strategy matters\" 转向\n\n    \"evaluation methodology dominates, mining strategy is noise\"。\n\n    具体分解：pool size effect(14pp) > seed variance(2.7pp) > criterion(2.7pp) >> strategy(0.4pp)。\n\n    Paper 的 prescriptive contribution：(1) 永远报告 pool=50+ 的 R@1；\n\n    (2) 用目标 metric 选 checkpoint 而非 val_loss；(3) 报告 mean±CI 跨 seeds。\n\n    '\n- name: RepoBench-R Cross-file Retrieval Evaluation\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: RepoBench-R test_easy/test_hard 上 3 strategies × 3 seeds 评估\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_random_easy_R@1_mean: 0.682\n    qwen_embed_easy_R@1_mean: 0.687\n    qwen_dataflow_easy_R@1_mean: 0.679\n    embed_vs_random_easy_delta_pp: 0.5\n    embed_vs_random_easy_95CI_pp:\n    - -0.3\n    - 1.3\n    qwen_random_hard_R@1_mean: 0.415\n    qwen_embed_hard_R@1_mean: 0.419\n    qwen_dataflow_hard_R@1_mean: 0.411\n    embed_vs_random_hard_delta_pp: 0.4\n    embed_vs_random_hard_95CI_pp:\n    - -0.5\n    - 1.3\n    starcoder_random_hard_R@1_mean: 0.358\n    starcoder_embed_hard_R@1_mean: 0.357\n    starcoder_embed_vs_random_hard_delta_pp: -0.1\n    ci_overlap_easy: true\n    ci_overlap_hard: true\n  result_rationale: 'RepoBench-R 是 cross-file retrieval task，与 SWE-smith 相比 domain\n    shift 较小\n\n    （同为 code retrieval 而非 repair），所以模型 transfer 好于 SWE-bench（OOD failure）。\n\n    Direction 一致（Qwen embed > random）但效果量与 SWE-smith 内部评估一致（~0.4-0.5pp），\n\n    95% CI 因为 bootstrap over 8K instances 虽然窄一些但仍包含零\n\n    （因为 per-instance variance 大，且效果量太小）。\n\n    StarCoder 同样 null，与 SWE-smith 结果一致。\n\n    RepoBench-R 的主要价值是 \"directional consistency\" 而非 \"statistical confirmation\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: RepoBench-R Results (mean R@1 ± 95% CI)'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - Split\n    - Random\n    - Embedding\n    - Δ (CI)\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - easy\n      - '0.682'\n      - '0.687'\n      - +0.5pp (-0.3, 1.3)\n    - - Qwen\n      - hard\n      - '0.415'\n      - '0.419'\n      - +0.4pp (-0.5, 1.3)\n    - - StarCoder\n      - easy\n      - '0.612'\n      - '0.611'\n      - -0.1pp (-0.9, 0.7)\n    - - StarCoder\n      - hard\n      - '0.358'\n      - '0.357'\n      - -0.1pp (-1.0, 0.8)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 7: RepoBench-R delta plot with CIs — directional consistency for Qwen but\n    CIs include zero'\n  analysis: 'RepoBench-R 作为 supplementary validation 支持 directional claim 但不提供 statistical\n    significance。\n\n    在 median 档的 methodology-first framing 下，这反而 reinforces 主论点：\n\n    <1pp effects 即使 directionally consistent 也无法在 standard evaluation 中 reliably detect。\n\n    '\n- name: Temperature Ablation Reduced\n  plan_id: plan_021\n  description: τ ∈ {0.05, 0.2} × random+embedding × Qwen × seed 42\n  expected_results:\n    tau005_random_R@1: 0.535\n    tau005_embed_R@1: 0.541\n    tau005_embed_vs_random_pp: 0.6\n    tau010_random_R@1: 0.5527\n    tau010_embed_R@1: 0.5613\n    tau010_embed_vs_random_pp: 0.86\n    tau020_random_R@1: 0.568\n    tau020_embed_R@1: 0.57\n    tau020_embed_vs_random_pp: 0.2\n    strategy_ranking_preserved: true\n    delta_magnitude_varies: true\n    tau005_vs_tau010_absolute_gap_pp: 1.77\n    tau020_vs_tau010_absolute_gap_pp: 1.53\n  result_rationale: 'τ=0.05 使 loss landscape 更 sharp，对 hard negatives 更 sensitive——理论上应放大\n    mining effect。\n\n    实际上 τ=0.05 更容易 overfit（已在 pilot 中观察到），absolute R@1 略低于 τ=0.10。\n\n    但 embed-random delta 在 τ=0.05 下 slightly larger（0.6pp vs 0.86pp... 实际上更小）。\n\n    τ=0.20 使 contrastive loss 更 smooth，random 和 embed 差异缩小（0.2pp），\n\n    因为 softer temperature 减少了 hard negative 的 informative gradient signal。\n\n    关键结论：strategy ranking 在所有 τ 下保持（embed ≥ random），但 effect magnitude 与 τ 相关。\n\n    这意味着 mining effect 不是 regime-specific artifact，但其 practical significance 受 τ 调制。\n\n    对 methodology framing：τ 选择（absolute R@1 vary ~2pp across τ）也是一个 methodology confound，\n\n    量级仍 > strategy effect（0.2-0.9pp）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: Temperature × Strategy Interaction (Qwen, s42)'\n    columns:\n    - τ\n    - Random R@1\n    - Embed R@1\n    - Δ (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - 0.05\n      - 0.535\n      - 0.541\n      - '+0.60'\n    - - 0.1\n      - 0.5527\n      - 0.5613\n      - '+0.86'\n    - - 0.2\n      - 0.568\n      - 0.57\n      - '+0.20'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 8: Temperature effect on absolute R@1 (~2pp range) vs strategy effect (<1pp)\n    — another methodology factor'\n  analysis: 'Embed advantage 在所有 τ 下存在但 magnitude 随 τ 变化。这 rules out \"effect is τ=0.1\n    artifact\"。\n\n    同时也展示了 τ 是另一个 methodology confound（2pp range），再次支持 criterion-dominates framing。\n\n    '\n- name: Dynamic Embedding Mining Baseline\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: 每 epoch 重新 mine embedding negatives vs 只用 pretrained（static）\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_static_embed_R@1: 0.5613\n    qwen_dynamic_embed_R@1: 0.564\n    dynamic_vs_static_delta_pp: 0.27\n    starcoder_static_embed_R@1: 0.4567\n    starcoder_dynamic_embed_R@1: 0.459\n    dynamic_vs_static_sc_delta_pp: 0.23\n    dynamic_overhead_factor: 3.2\n  result_rationale: 'Dynamic mining 理论上应 better 因为 negatives adapt to evolving encoder。\n\n    但实际提升微小（~0.2-0.3pp）因为：(1) LoRA 只 fine-tune adapter，base embedding 变化小；\n\n    (2) 3 epochs 太短，encoder drift 有限；(3) Qwen saturated space 意味着 re-mining 后\n\n    top-k negatives 几乎不变（cos sim 都在 0.96+ 区间，ranking 高度稳定）。\n\n    训练时间 3.2x（每 epoch 需要重新 encode 全 corpus + mine），ROI 极低。\n\n    结论：static mining 是合理 baseline，dynamic 不是 confound。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: Static vs Dynamic Mining'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - Static\n    - Dynamic\n    - Δ (pp)\n    - Time multiplier\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - 0.5613\n      - 0.564\n      - '+0.27'\n      - 3.2x\n    - - StarCoder\n      - 0.4567\n      - 0.459\n      - '+0.23'\n      - 3.2x\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 9: Negligible dynamic benefit — validates static mining as non-confounded\n    baseline'\n  analysis: 'Dynamic mining 仅提供 ~0.25pp marginal gain over static，且 computational\n    cost 3.2x。\n\n    This validates that static mining is a fair comparison point（reviewer concern\n    addressed）。\n\n    Also supports narrative：even \"better\" mining only adds 0.25pp → methodology still\n    dominates。\n\n    '\n- name: UniXcoder Multi-seed Validation\n  plan_id: plan_020\n  description: UniXcoder-base 125M 上 3 strategies × 3 seeds 统计验证\n  expected_results:\n    unixcoder_random_s42_R@1: 0.5534\n    unixcoder_embed_s42_R@1: 0.5497\n    unixcoder_dataflow_s42_R@1: 0.551\n    unixcoder_random_s43_R@1: 0.577\n    unixcoder_embed_s43_R@1: 0.574\n    unixcoder_dataflow_s43_R@1: 0.5755\n    unixcoder_random_s44_R@1: 0.562\n    unixcoder_embed_s44_R@1: 0.559\n    unixcoder_dataflow_s44_R@1: 0.56\n    unixcoder_random_mean_R@1: 0.5641\n    unixcoder_embed_mean_R@1: 0.5609\n    unixcoder_dataflow_mean_R@1: 0.5622\n    embed_vs_random_mean_pp: -0.32\n    dataflow_vs_random_mean_pp: -0.19\n    all_within_noise: true\n    max_span_across_strategies_pp: 0.37\n  result_rationale: 'UniXcoder s42 已确认 null result（0.37pp span across all strategies）。\n\n    Multi-seed 会重复这个 pattern：UniXcoder 作为 encoder-only 125M model，\n\n    其 representation 是 mean-pooled 而非 last-token，embedding space 结构与 decoder-only\n    不同。\n\n    Mining strategy 对 encoder-only architecture 完全无效的原因：\n\n    (1) 125M params 的 adapter 容量有限，hard negatives 的额外 gradient 无法被 absorbed；\n\n    (2) encoder-only mean-pooling 产生的 similarity distribution 不同于 decoder last-token，\n\n    mining 不 align with the model''s actual difficulty gradient。\n\n    这个 null result 在 paper 中不再是 limitation 而是 positive evidence：\n\n    \"effect is encoder-specific, confirming geometry hypothesis\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: UniXcoder-base Results (complete null)'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - Random\n    - Embed\n    - Dataflow\n    - Max Span\n    rows:\n    - - 42\n      - 0.5534\n      - 0.5497\n      - 0.551\n      - 0.37pp\n    - - 43\n      - 0.577\n      - 0.574\n      - 0.5755\n      - 0.30pp\n    - - 44\n      - 0.562\n      - 0.559\n      - 0.56\n      - 0.30pp\n    - - Mean\n      - 0.5641\n      - 0.5609\n      - 0.5622\n      - 0.32pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 10: UniXcoder — flat lines across strategies, contrasted with Qwen''s marginal\n    slope'\n  analysis: 'UniXcoder null + StarCoder weak = ''effect is encoder-specific, not universal''。\n\n    在 methodology-first framing 下，这反而 strengthens 论文：即使最 favorable 的条件\n\n    （Qwen saturated geometry）也只有 <1pp effect，其他 architecture 完全 null。\n\n    Mining strategy choice 在 typical evaluation 中完全不 matter。\n\n    '\n- name: Stratified Analysis by Structural Data Availability\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 5 strata 分析：repo size, pool size, query-pos similarity, structural\n    data availability, neg_difficulty quartile\n  expected_results:\n    rich_dataflow_embed_vs_random_delta_pp: 0.55\n    fallback_embed_vs_random_delta_pp: 0.3\n    rich_dataflow_99pct_in_large_repos: true\n    cannot_isolate_dataflow_from_repo_size: true\n    small_pool_lt20_delta_pp: 0.6\n    large_pool_gt100_delta_pp: 0.35\n    q1_low_difficulty_delta_pp: 0.15\n    q4_high_difficulty_delta_pp: 0.7\n    difficulty_gradient_predicts_benefit: true\n    but_all_effects_within_ci_noise: true\n  result_rationale: \"Stratified analysis 会显示 directional patterns：\\n(1) Rich-dataflow\\\n    \\ instances（34%）show slightly larger embed benefit because these instances \\n\\\n    \\    tend to be in complex repos where random negatives are worse-quality；\\n(2)\\\n    \\ 但 99.3% rich-dataflow 在 large/xlarge repos，无法解耦 dataflow richness 和 repo complexity；\\n\\\n    (3) neg_difficulty quartile 最有解释力：high-difficulty negatives（Q4）对应更大的 embed benefit，\\n\\\n    \\    因为 embed mining 选出的 negatives 比 random 更接近 difficulty optimal zone；\\n(4)\\\n    \\ 所有 strata 的 effect 都在 noise floor 内（CI 包含 zero）。\\n这支持 geometry hypothesis 但不能作为\\\n    \\ statistical evidence。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11: Stratified embed-random Δ (Qwen, all seeds pooled)'\n    columns:\n    - Stratum\n    - N\n    - Δ (pp)\n    - 95% CI\n    rows:\n    - - Rich dataflow (34%)\n      - ~4800\n      - '+0.55'\n      - (-0.4, 1.5)\n    - - Fallback (66%)\n      - ~9300\n      - '+0.30'\n      - (-0.5, 1.1)\n    - - Small repo (<50 files)\n      - ~500\n      - '+0.80'\n      - (-1.5, 3.1)\n    - - Large repo (200+ files)\n      - ~8600\n      - '+0.35'\n      - (-0.5, 1.2)\n    - - neg_difficulty Q1 (easy)\n      - ~3500\n      - '+0.15'\n      - (-0.8, 1.1)\n    - - neg_difficulty Q4 (hard)\n      - ~3500\n      - '+0.70'\n      - (-0.3, 1.7)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 11: Stratified delta forest plot — all CIs include zero but directional pattern\n    visible'\n  - 'Fig 12: neg_difficulty quartile × strategy interaction — monotonic trend supports\n    geometry hypothesis'\n  analysis: 'Stratified analysis 提供 mechanistic depth 但无 statistical power。\n\n    在 median 档 framing 中作为 \"exploratory evidence for geometry hypothesis\"。\n\n    关键 insight：confound between repo_size 和 dataflow_richness 意味着\n\n    不能单独 attribute benefit to structural information。\n\n    '\n- name: 1-hop vs 2-hop vs 3-hop Call-graph Bounding\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: CodeQL 提取时 data-flow scope 对 connected set 大小和 downstream training\n    的影响\n  expected_results:\n    hop1_connected_mean_files: 3.2\n    hop2_connected_mean_files: 8.7\n    hop3_connected_mean_files: 18.4\n    hop1_Z_pct: 0.52\n    hop2_Z_pct: 0.78\n    hop3_Z_pct: 0.89\n    hop1_dataflow_R@1: 0.548\n    hop2_dataflow_R@1: 0.551\n    hop3_dataflow_R@1: 0.549\n    hop_effect_range_pp: 0.3\n  result_rationale: \"增加 hop 数扩大 connected set（从 3.2 到 18.4 mean files），增加 Z%，\\n但 downstream\\\n    \\ training 差异极小（0.3pp range）。原因：\\n(1) Dataflow strategy 本身效果已经 ≈ random（median\\\n    \\ 档 dataflow-random ≈ -1pp），\\n    所以 connected set 的精确度差异被掩盖；\\n(2) 更多 hops 包含更多\\\n    \\ spurious connections（transitive dependencies 不等于 semantic relatedness），\\n  \\\n    \\  noise 抵消了 coverage gain；\\n(3) 在 2-hop（当前设置）下 Z%=78% 已经 adequate——大部分 true positives\\\n    \\ 已被 captured。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 12: Hop Depth Ablation'\n    columns:\n    - Hops\n    - Mean connected files\n    - Z%\n    - Dataflow R@1\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 3.2\n      - 52%\n      - 0.548\n    - - 2\n      - 8.7\n      - 78%\n      - 0.551\n    - - 3\n      - 18.4\n      - 89%\n      - 0.549\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 13: Hop depth vs connected set size (log scale) — diminishing returns past\n    2-hop'\n  analysis: \"2-hop 是合理 default（coverage/noise trade-off），但 choice of hop depth\\n对\\\n    \\ downstream training 几乎无影响。又一个 methodology variant (hop depth) \\nwhose effect\\\n    \\ << criterion effect。\\n\"\n- name: Training Data Size Scaling\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: 1K vs 3K vs 5K vs 11K+ instances 的 scaling 行为\n  expected_results:\n    size_1K_R@1: 0.505\n    size_3K_R@1: 0.531\n    size_5K_R@1: 0.543\n    size_11K_R@1: 0.5527\n    size_1K_embed_delta_pp: 1.2\n    size_3K_embed_delta_pp: 0.8\n    size_5K_embed_delta_pp: 0.55\n    size_11K_embed_delta_pp: 0.86\n    random_scaling_log_slope: 0.023\n    effect_diminishes_with_data: true\n  result_rationale: '更多数据提升 absolute performance（log-linear scaling），但同时 diminishes\n    mining advantage。\n\n    原因：larger random corpus 本身 covers 更多 hard negatives by chance，\n\n    reducing the marginal value of targeted mining。\n\n    At 1K，random sampling 的 coverage 差，mining 的相对优势大（+1.2pp）；\n\n    at 11K，random 已经 sample 了 enough hard examples that mining only adds +0.86pp。\n\n    这解释了为何 full-scale effect < pilot effect（pilot 用较小数据集）。\n\n    在 methodology framing 中：data size（5pp range from 1K→11K）是又一个 >> strategy effect\n    的 factor。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 13: Data Size Scaling'\n    columns:\n    - Size\n    - Random R@1\n    - Embed R@1\n    - Δ (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - 1K\n      - 0.505\n      - 0.517\n      - '+1.20'\n    - - 3K\n      - 0.531\n      - 0.539\n      - '+0.80'\n    - - 5K\n      - 0.543\n      - 0.548\n      - '+0.55'\n    - - 11K\n      - 0.553\n      - 0.561\n      - '+0.86'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 14: Log-linear scaling curves for random and embed — converging at larger\n    data sizes'\n  analysis: 'Data size effect (5pp) >> strategy effect (<1pp)。Mining advantage diminishes\n    with more data，\n\n    suggesting that at even larger scale the effect may vanish entirely。\n\n    11K 的 delta 略回弹（0.86 > 0.55 at 5K）可能是 noise 或 composition effect（\n\n    更多 instances 中包含更多 hard cases where mining helps）。\n\n    '\n- name: Bootstrap 95% CI for All Claims\n  plan_id: plan_016 (adapted from SWE-bench to main results)\n  description: 对 SWE-smith validation 上的 strategy comparisons 做 bootstrap CI（SWE-bench\n    已放弃）\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_embed_vs_random_bootstrap_mean_pp: 0.4\n    qwen_embed_vs_random_bootstrap_95CI_pp:\n    - -0.82\n    - 1.62\n    qwen_embed_vs_random_p_value: 0.26\n    ci_excludes_zero: false\n    qwen_dataflow_vs_random_bootstrap_mean_pp: -0.99\n    qwen_dataflow_vs_random_bootstrap_95CI_pp:\n    - -2.45\n    - 0.47\n    starcoder_embed_vs_random_bootstrap_mean_pp: -0.06\n    starcoder_embed_vs_random_bootstrap_95CI_pp:\n    - -1.52\n    - 1.4\n    bm25_vs_random_bootstrap_mean_pp: -0.12\n    bm25_vs_random_bootstrap_95CI_pp:\n    - -1.2\n    - 0.96\n    qwen_embed_cohens_d: 0.18\n    starcoder_embed_cohens_d: 0.03\n    power_analysis_required_seeds_for_05pp: 12\n  result_rationale: \"With only 3 seeds per condition, 95% CI is approximately mean\\\n    \\ ± t(0.025, df=2) × SE。\\nFor cross_seed_std = 2.7pp and n=3：SE = 2.7/√3 = 1.56pp,\\\n    \\ t(0.025,2)=4.3 → CI = ±6.7pp... \\n这太宽了。实际上 bootstrap CI 用的是 paired delta（each\\\n    \\ seed 的 embed - random），\\npaired delta std 更小（~1.0pp因为 seeds co-vary）。\\nPaired\\\n    \\ delta: s42=+0.86, s43=+1.01, s44=-0.67 → mean=0.40, std=0.93, SE=0.54。\\n95%\\\n    \\ CI (bootstrap percentile) ≈ [-0.82, 1.62]，包含零。\\nCohen's d = 0.40/2.2 = 0.18（small\\\n    \\ effect）。\\nPower analysis：要 detect 0.5pp effect with 80% power at α=0.05，需要 ~12\\\n    \\ seeds。\\n3 seeds 的 statistical power 对 <1pp effect 约为 15-20%，underpowered。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 14: Statistical Summary (all comparisons)'\n    columns:\n    - Comparison\n    - Mean Δ (pp)\n    - 95% CI\n    - Cohen's d\n    - p-value\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen Embed-Random\n      - '+0.40'\n      - (-0.82, 1.62)\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.26'\n    - - Qwen Dataflow-Random\n      - '-0.99'\n      - (-2.45, 0.47)\n      - '0.42'\n      - '0.12'\n    - - StarCoder Embed-Random\n      - '-0.06'\n      - (-1.52, 1.40)\n      - '0.03'\n      - '0.94'\n    - - BM25-Random (pooled)\n      - '-0.12'\n      - (-1.20, 0.96)\n      - '0.05'\n      - '0.82'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 15: Forest plot of all strategy comparisons with 95% CIs — none exclude zero'\n  - 'Fig 16: Power curve showing 3 seeds gives ~18% power for 0.5pp detection'\n  analysis: '所有 CI 都包含零。这不意味着 effect 不存在，而是 3 seeds 对 <1pp effects 统计力度不足。\n\n    Paper 的 honest framing：report effect sizes + CIs，承认 underpowered，\n\n    argue that the FINDING is \"methodology matters more\" not \"mining helps\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Fusion Head Ablation\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: embedding-only vs structural-features-only vs combined retrieval\n  expected_results:\n    embedding_only_R@1: 0.5613\n    structural_only_R@1: 0.32\n    combined_R@1: 0.565\n    combined_vs_embed_delta_pp: 0.37\n  result_rationale: 'Structural features alone（graph-based without neural embedding）表现差\n\n    因为 coverage 只有 34%（66% instances 无 structural data → random guess）。\n\n    Combined（embedding + structural re-rank）marginal gain over embedding-only（+0.37pp）\n\n    因为 structural signal 只在 34% instances 上有效，且其信号与 embedding 高度相关\n\n    （connected files 通常也是 embedding-similar files，overlap 87%）。\n\n    这进一步支持 \"mining strategy 差异小\" 的 narrative。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 15: Fusion Head Ablation'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - R@1\n    - Coverage\n    rows:\n    - - Embedding only\n      - 0.5613\n      - 100%\n    - - Structural only\n      - 0.32\n      - 34% effective\n    - - Combined\n      - 0.565\n      - 100%\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Structural signal alone insufficient due to coverage gap。\n\n    Combined 仅 marginal gain，reinforcing that embedding-based retrieval\n\n    captures most of what structural information provides。\n\n    '\n- name: Dataflow-distance Weighted Negatives\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: 按 dataflow distance 连续加权 vs 二值 connected/disconnected\n  expected_results:\n    binary_dataflow_R@1: 0.551\n    weighted_dataflow_R@1: 0.553\n    weighted_vs_binary_delta_pp: 0.2\n  result_rationale: 'Connected/disconnected 二值划分已经 capture 了 structural signal 的主要信息量。\n\n    连续权重（distance = 1 vs 2 vs 3 hops）只提供 marginal refinement（+0.2pp），\n\n    因为 (1) distance distribution 本身 noisy（CodeQL 的 hop count 不是 clean metric），\n\n    (2) 二值判断（is_connected）在 linear proxy 中已是 top feature (+2.82 coefficient），\n\n    graded distance 的 incremental information content 有限。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Minimal improvement over binary。Further confirms that structural signal\n\n    is coarse-grained (connected vs not) rather than fine-grained (distance-weighted).\n\n    '\n- name: Failure Analysis on SWE-bench Failures\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 50 BM25 baseline failures 分类分析\n  expected_results:\n    total_analyzed: 50\n    category_cross_repo_import: 12\n    category_test_only_change: 15\n    category_distant_dependency: 8\n    category_config_files: 7\n    category_other: 8\n    dataflow_could_help_pct: 16\n    dataflow_irrelevant_pct: 72\n    dataflow_would_hurt_pct: 12\n  result_rationale: 'SWE-bench 的 R@1=0.04 failure 主要来自 OOD 问题（不同 repo 分布），\n\n    而非 mining strategy 不足。分析 50 个 BM25 failure case：\n\n    大多数是 test file changes（30%）和 cross-repo import patterns（24%）——\n\n    这些情况下 dataflow mining 无法帮助，因为 (1) test files 通常不在 dataflow graph 中，\n\n    (2) SWE-bench 的 repo 不在训练集中。\n\n    只有 ~16% cases 理论上 dataflow 可以帮助（distant dependency chains）。\n\n    这 reinforces director decision to drop SWE-bench from paper。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 16: Failure Case Taxonomy'\n    columns:\n    - Category\n    - Count\n    - Dataflow relevance\n    rows:\n    - - Test-only changes\n      - 15\n      - Irrelevant\n    - - Cross-repo import\n      - 12\n      - Irrelevant\n    - - Distant dependency\n      - 8\n      - Could help\n    - - Config/build files\n      - 7\n      - Irrelevant\n    - - Other\n      - 8\n      - Mixed\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'SWE-bench failure is OOD generalization problem, not mining strategy\n    problem。\n\n    Confirms paper should not mention SWE-bench。RepoBench-R is better external validation。\n\n    '\n- name: Qualitative Retrieval Examples\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 5-10 cases where embedding mining changed retrieval outcome vs random\n  expected_results:\n    total_diff_cases_found: 23\n    selected_for_paper: 5\n    pattern_A_embed_promotes_import_chain: 2\n    pattern_B_embed_demotes_unrelated_similar: 2\n    pattern_C_marginal_reranking: 1\n    avg_rank_change_in_selected: 3.2\n  result_rationale: '由于 overall delta 只有 ~0.4pp (pool=8)，找到 embed mining 改变 R@1 outcome\n    的\n\n    cases 需要 search relatively large eval set。在 ~1400 instances 中，\n\n    约 23 cases 的 top-1 因 strategy 不同而变化（1.6% cases）。\n\n    选出的 5 cases 展示 3 个 pattern：\n\n    (1) Embed mining 正确将 import-chain neighbor 排到 top（2 cases）；\n\n    (2) Embed mining 正确降低了 lexically similar but unrelated files（2 cases）；\n\n    (3) Marginal re-ranking where embed barely wins（1 case）。\n\n    Avg rank change 只有 3.2 positions（不是 dramatic re-ordering）。\n\n    Qualitative 支持 directional argument 但 quantitative impact is small。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 17: 2-3 cherry-picked examples showing embed mining vs random retrieval outcome\n    difference'\n  analysis: 'Qualitative examples 提供 intuition 但数量少（only 1.6% instances affected）。\n\n    在 paper 中作为 \"illustrative\" 而非 \"representative\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Full Temperature Ablation\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: τ ∈ {0.05, 0.1, 0.2} × all 3 strategies × 2 encoders\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_tau005_random_R@1: 0.535\n    qwen_tau005_embed_R@1: 0.541\n    qwen_tau005_dataflow_R@1: 0.53\n    qwen_tau020_random_R@1: 0.568\n    qwen_tau020_embed_R@1: 0.57\n    qwen_tau020_dataflow_R@1: 0.565\n    starcoder_tau005_random_R@1: 0.435\n    starcoder_tau005_embed_R@1: 0.434\n    starcoder_tau020_random_R@1: 0.49\n    starcoder_tau020_embed_R@1: 0.489\n    tau_effect_on_absolute_R@1_pp: 3.3\n    tau_effect_on_strategy_delta: preserves ranking but modulates magnitude\n    strategy_ranking_invariant_to_tau: true\n  result_rationale: 'Full ablation extends plan_021 to StarCoder and dataflow。\n\n    StarCoder 在所有 τ 下保持 null（embed ≈ random），因为 geometry effect 与 τ 独立。\n\n    τ 对 absolute R@1 的影响（~3.3pp across Qwen）是 yet another methodology confound。\n\n    Strategy ranking invariant confirms mining effect is real (if small) but regime-independent。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 17: Full τ × Strategy × Encoder Grid'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - τ\n    - Random\n    - Embed\n    - Dataflow\n    - Embed-Random Δ\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.535\n      - 0.541\n      - 0.53\n      - +0.60pp\n    - - Qwen\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.553\n      - 0.561\n      - 0.551\n      - +0.86pp\n    - - Qwen\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.568\n      - 0.57\n      - 0.565\n      - +0.20pp\n    - - StarCoder\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.435\n      - 0.434\n      - 0.43\n      - -0.10pp\n    - - StarCoder\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.46\n      - 0.457\n      - 0.449\n      - -0.37pp\n    - - StarCoder\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.49\n      - 0.489\n      - 0.485\n      - -0.10pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 18: Heatmap of R@1 across τ × strategy × encoder — shows τ dominates'\n  analysis: 'τ effect (3.3pp) is another methodology confound >> strategy effect。\n\n    Strategy ranking consistent across τ but magnitude varies → not a τ-specific artifact。\n\n    '\n- name: UniXcoder 3-strat s43 Completion\n  plan_id: plan_020 (partial)\n  description: UniXcoder s43 embedding + dataflow 完成\n  expected_results:\n    embed_s43_R@1: 0.574\n    dataflow_s43_R@1: 0.5755\n    random_s43_R@1: 0.577\n    max_span_pp: 0.3\n    confirms_null: true\n  result_rationale: 's43 random 已完成（0.577）。Embed 和 dataflow 会在 ±0.3pp 内。\n\n    UniXcoder 125M encoder-only 对 mining strategy 完全不敏感，\n\n    multi-seed 只是 confirm s42 的 null with more confidence。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Confirms UniXcoder null. 3-encoder evidence: Qwen marginal, StarCoder\n    null, UniXcoder null.'\n- name: D062 综合 Criterion Effect 验证\n  plan_id: derived from plan_019 + plan_021 + full results\n  description: 综合所有实验量化 checkpoint criterion effect vs mining strategy effect\n  expected_results:\n    methodology_factors:\n      pool_size_effect_pp: 14.2\n      temperature_effect_pp: 3.3\n      seed_variance_pp: 2.7\n      checkpoint_criterion_pp: 2.7\n      data_size_effect_5x_pp: 4.8\n      total_methodology_range_pp: 16.0\n    strategy_factors:\n      best_mining_strategy_effect_pp: 0.4\n      strategy_as_pct_of_methodology: 2.5\n    paper_framing_support:\n      ratio_methodology_to_strategy: 40\n      claim_strength: Strong — criterion effect is 40× larger than best strategy effect\n      narrative: Evaluation methodology (pool size, criterion, seed, τ) accounts for\n        >95% of variance in reported results. Mining strategy choice is a rounding\n        error.\n  result_rationale: '汇总所有 methodology confounds：pool_size(14pp) + τ(3.3pp) + seed(2.7pp)\n    + criterion(2.7pp) + data_size(4.8pp)。\n\n    总 methodology range 约 16pp（不是简单加法，因为有重叠和 interaction），\n\n    而 best mining strategy effect = 0.4pp。\n\n    这是 paper 的核心贡献：发现 evaluation methodology 的系统性问题，\n\n    mining strategy 的 reported effects 在文献中可能 largely driven by methodology choices\n    而非 true signal。\n\n    这解释了为何 prior work 有 contradictory findings（不同 papers 用不同 pool sizes, τ, criterion）。\n\n    Prescriptive contribution：建议 community 标准化 evaluation protocol。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 18: Methodology Confound Summary (Paper Core Contribution)'\n    columns:\n    - Factor\n    - Effect Range (pp)\n    - vs Strategy δ (0.4pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Evaluation pool size (8→50)\n      - '14.2'\n      - 35×\n    - - Training data size (1K→11K)\n      - '4.8'\n      - 12×\n    - - Temperature (0.05→0.20)\n      - '3.3'\n      - 8×\n    - - Seed variance (within strategy)\n      - '2.7'\n      - 7×\n    - - Checkpoint criterion (loss vs R@1)\n      - '2.7'\n      - 7×\n    - - Mining strategy (best case)\n      - '0.4'\n      - 1×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 19 (Paper Hero Figure): Bar chart showing methodology factors dwarfing strategy\n    effect — visual argument for paper''s thesis'\n  analysis: '这是 median 档 paper 最终形态的核心数据。叙事从 \"embedding mining helps code retrieval\"\n\n    转变为 \"evaluation methodology choices dominate mining strategy effects by 40×—\n\n    the field needs standardized evaluation protocols before claiming mining improvements\"。\n\n    Claims 重排：(1) methodology dominance (+10-16pp vs <1pp), (2) within controlled\n    methodology\n\n    embedding shows conditional marginal benefit on saturated-geometry encoders, (3)\n    geometry analysis\n\n    explains encoder-specificity。'\n","numLines":1321,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1321}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01MjpRXdbwwFNxBLDegu8uCf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have now read both the PDF paper and the review context YAML. Let me understand what I need to do:\n\n1. This is a full review (dream-review-full) with 2 Reviewers:\n   - R1: Methods + Experiments\n   - R2: Novelty + Related Work\n2. Complete roundtable: Step 1 (independent reviews) → Step 2 (cross-share) → Step 3 (converge) → Step 4 (synthesize)\n3. After the review, submit via `submit_dream_review_report`\n\nLet me dispatch R1 and R2 as parallel agents, then run the roundtable.\n\n\nThe paper's central finding is that evaluation methodology—particularly pool size, checkpoint selection, temperature, seed, and data size—drives 10-16 percentage points of variation in contrastive code retrieval performance, while the best mining strategy contributes only 0.4pp, a 40× difference. The effect varies by encoder, with Qwen showing minimal gains and StarCoder and UniXcoder showing none, which the authors explain through embedding space saturation where harder negatives provide diminishing returns.\n\nNow I'm considering the experimental scope—the paper acknowledges that three seeds is statistically underpowered, but compensates with extensive ablations across 18 tables covering pool size sensitivity, checkpoint criteria, temperature effects, data scaling, dynamic mining strategies, and performance on RepoBench-R with stratified analysis. I should launch two reviewer agents to evaluate this comprehensively.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":39306,"cache_read_input_tokens":22938,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":39306},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,